	quest.05E8D4A697D4E6AE.quest_desc: [
		"Chipped benches humming, leaded glass in the windows, a Gigantic Charmander on the shelf and gold-trimmed chests."
		""
		"Your base is officially the most comfortable place in the region. Click the checkmark to claim your reward."
