	quest.079EA423E67E8BC0.title: "Power Points"
	quest.07A83F5F1CF2AF61.quest_desc: [
		"A &ePoké Snack&r is a cake that draws wild Pokémon to it. Recipe: 3 &eMilk&r (bucket or Moomoo Milk), 2 &eHoney Bottles&r, a &eVivichoke&r and 3 &eHearty Grains&r."
		""
		"Season it with Berries or golden fruit to choose what it attracts, then place it down and wait nearby."
	]
