		"Catch 10 &1Dragon&r-type Pokémon. Dual-type Pokémon count for both of their types."
		""
		"&6Strong against:&r Dragon"
	]
	quest.098CBD3BC00AA833.title: "Here Be Dragons"
	quest.099ACEF58006A47E.quest_desc: [
		"All seven honours are yours. Trainer, battler, ranger, explorer and builder: you have done it all."
		""
		"Welcome to the Hall of Fame, &6Champion of Origins&r. Your reward includes a &eMaster Ball&r: save it for the one Pokémon that truly deserves it."
	]
	quest.099ACEF58006A47E.quest_subtitle: "The crown is yours"
	quest.099ACEF58006A47E.title: "Champion of Origins"
	quest.09BB78A2A91DA455.quest_desc: [
		"Craft &eSoul Torches&r from Coal or Charcoal, a Stick and &eSoul Sand&r or &eSoul Soil&r."
		""
		"&aTip:&r Piglins are repelled by soul fire: Soul Torches, Soul Lanterns and Soul Campfires keep them away from your base."
	]
	quest.09BB78A2A91DA455.title: "Blue Flames"
	quest.09BE9633C7672E13.quest_desc: [
		"Find a &6Bamboo Jungle&r."
		""
		"Pancham and Stufful live among the stalks."
		"&oThe ultra-rare Kubfu trains here.&r"
	]
	quest.09BE9633C7672E13.title: "Bamboozled"
	quest.09BF94A3ACB39210.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e2,500 CobbleDollars&r for one."
