		"Catch a &eTogepi&r."
		""
		"It is a rare spawn in flowery places such as the &6Flower Forest&r."
		"&aTip:&r the Green Apricorns from this quest go into &eFriend Balls&r, a fine match for a Pokémon that evolves through friendship."
	]
	quest.0A73B57EA409CA78.title: "A Lucky Find"
	quest.0AA3AC761AB771E0.quest_desc: [
		"&eCrafting Table&r, &eIron&r and a &eChest&r around an &eUpgrade Base&r."
		""
		"Adds a crafting table tab to the backpack, so you can craft wherever you are."
	]
	quest.0AA3AC761AB771E0.title: "Crafting Upgrade"
	quest.0AE918340484212A.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat 25 wild &6Ground&r-type Pokémon in battle."
		""
		"&6Weak to:&r Grass, Ice, Water"
		"&cResists:&r Poison, Rock"
		"&cImmune to:&r Electric"
	]
	quest.0AE918340484212A.title: "Ground Control"
	quest.0AEEE5DB6E0A8353.quest_desc: [
		"Catch &e5&r Pokémon in swamp biomes (Terralith variants count)."
		""
		"&bLotad&r, &bCroagunk&r, &bGrimer&r, &bKarrablast&r and &bMurkrow&r lurk in the murk."
	]
	quest.0AEEE5DB6E0A8353.title: "Swamp Thing"
	quest.0AFED46B5DB72507.quest_desc: [
		"Wild battles are where your team grows. This chapter covers &elevels&r, &eEVs&r, &eIVs&r, &eNatures&r, &eheld items&r, &eTMs&r and &eabilities&r."
		""
		"&6How experience works here&r"
		"&eExp. All is off&r: only Pokémon that battle, or that hold an &eExp. Share&r (half a share), earn experience. Fainted Pokémon earn nothing, so switch out before they drop."
		""
		"&aCatching a Pokémon mid-battle also gives your battler some experience and EVs.&r"
	]
	quest.0AFED46B5DB72507.quest_subtitle: "Battles are where Pokémon grow"
	quest.0AFED46B5DB72507.title: "&6&lTrain Hard, Battle Harder"
	quest.0B1971DED69EDA5D.quest_desc: ["Turn Oak Planks into &eBasket Woven Oak Planks&r with a Chipped workbench or its tool, then place it and look at it."]
	quest.0B1971DED69EDA5D.title: "Basket Woven Oak Planks"
	quest.0B1E5E8301151E54.quest_desc: ["Red Apricorn base: &e+2 Acceleration, -1 Stamina&r."]
	quest.0B1E5E8301151E54.title: "Red Aprijuice"
	quest.0B25902B2CC2ACEA.quest_desc: [
		"A &eCatching Charm&r sometimes turns up as bonus loot in a Raid Pouch."
		""
		"Hold it in your &eoffhand&r when you claim a raid boss to raise the catch rate. &aJade shows a den's catch rate when you look at it.&r"
	]
	quest.0B25902B2CC2ACEA.title: "Lucky Charm"
	quest.0B2DCBC7BE0F8A1F.quest_desc: [
		"Three Glass, two Quartz, a Calendar and three Cobblestone Slabs build a &eSeason Sensor&r."
		""
		"It gives off a redstone signal that changes with the season, ready to drive your farm machinery."
	]
	quest.0B2DCBC7BE0F8A1F.title: "Season Sensor"
	quest.0B2F009335775CC1.quest_desc: [
		"Raise any Pokémon to &elevel 50&r."
		""
		"&cThe level has to be gained while the Pokémon is yours: catching a high-level Pokémon only counts once it levels up again.&r"
	]
	quest.0B2F009335775CC1.title: "Halfway There"
	quest.0B4347E4D7D22DE7.quest_desc: ["Raise a Magikarp to level 20 and it becomes Gyarados. Worth every splash."]
