		"Fill a Treat Box with berries for each beast:"
		"&eEntei Treat&r: Liechi, Lansat, Occa and Razz Berries."
		"&eRaikou Treat&r: Salac, Petaya, Wacan and Nanab Berries."
		"&eSuicune Treat&r: Apicot, Ganlon, Passho and Wepear Berries."
		"&aLiechi, Lansat, Salac, Petaya, Apicot and Ganlon only come from berry mutation (see the Berries chapter).&r"
