	quest.1F7C8B6A420341E2.quest_desc: [
		"Strongholds here are &eYUNG's Better Strongholds&r: sprawling underground keeps with libraries, crypts, prisons and an armoury."
		""
		"Follow your thrown eyes until they dive into the ground, then dig down. Somewhere inside is the &eEnd Portal&r room."
