	quest.1F9DF1D5051BB1D2.quest_desc: ["&eAurora Essence&r drifts in forest biomes near the &bTree of Life&r. Fill 16 Jars with it and offer them to the Aurora X Log until the wood awakens and &dXerneas&r appears."]
