		"Cure a &2Zombie Villager&r: hit it with a &eSplash Potion of Weakness&r, then feed it a &eGolden Apple&r (8 Gold Ingots around an Apple). It turns back within a few minutes."
		""
		"A cured villager remembers its doctor and gives much better prices."
		"&cKeep it out of sunlight while it converts: it still burns until it is cured.&r"
