		"Catch &e3&r Pokémon on a &eMushroom Fields&r island."
		""
		"Rare ocean islands where &bSlowpoke&r, &bMiltank&r, &bShroomish&r and &bFoongus&r roam, and &bVivillon&r wear the Archipelago pattern."
	]
	quest.21B6AC7AE4AC831F.title: "Fungus Among Us"
	quest.21D9AB4AC95165EC.quest_desc: [
		"Combine a &eShulker Box&r (from the End) with a &eNetherite Ingot&r to forge a &eSafe&r."
		""
		"A safe belongs to whoever places it and can be locked with a &eKey&r. Like a shulker box it keeps everything inside when broken."
	]
	quest.21D9AB4AC95165EC.title: "Fort Knox"
	quest.21EC1A4A60E2CB74.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e2,000 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.21EC1A4A60E2CB74.quest_subtitle: "2,000 CD"
	quest.21EC1A4A60E2CB74.title: "Ice Gem"
	quest.21FADD4E06C7690F.quest_desc: [
		"&eNether Quartz Ore&r is everywhere in the netherrack and drops XP as well as &eQuartz&r."
		""
		"Quartz is a key part of &eComparators&r, &eObservers&r and &eDaylight Detectors&r, and of the Serene Seasons &eSeason Sensor&r."
	]
	quest.21FADD4E06C7690F.title: "Glittering Netherrack"
	quest.21FE47FF5C0ABA8F.quest_desc: [
		"&eGilded Blackstone&r is only found in Bastions and their chests."
		""
		"Piglins love it, and mining it can drop &eGold Nuggets&r."
	]
	quest.21FE47FF5C0ABA8F.title: "All That Glitters"
	quest.21FF94FB8B56D0C3.quest_desc: [
		"Fill every empty frame of the portal with an Eye of Ender and jump in."
		""
		"YUNG's Better End Island reshapes the central island and its towers. Pack food, plenty of blocks and a bow."
	]
	quest.21FF94FB8B56D0C3.title: "The Edge of the World"
	quest.220AE5FF5384536D.quest_desc: [
		"A &ePasture Block&r (Planks, a &ePC&r, a &eHopper&r and Wheat) lets up to 16 Pokémon from your PC roam around it."
		""
		"Pastured Pokémon can drop items over time. The &aBerries and Apricorns&r chapter covers what they produce."
	]
	quest.220AE5FF5384536D.title: "Free Roam: Enabled"
	quest.2211042E41DCDF53.quest_desc: [
		"One &eGold Ingot&r and two &eGold Nuggets&r make a &eKey&r."
		""
		"Keys lock &eSafes&r and &eLock Blocks&r: once something is bound to a key, only a matching key opens it."
	]
	quest.2211042E41DCDF53.title: "Lock and Key"
	quest.22213B19B7ABFAE1.quest_desc: ["Open a Lootr &etrapped chest&r. YUNG temples, fortresses and strongholds like to hide loot in them, so mind the redstone."]
	quest.22213B19B7ABFAE1.title: "Surprise Inside"
	quest.224692CBB768E5EB.quest_desc: [
		"Craft an &eUltra Ball&r: 2 &eYellow&r and 2 &eBlack Apricorns&r around a &eGold Ingot&r."
		""
		"2x catch rate: the best general-purpose ball you can mass-produce. A Gold core also makes Dusk, Love, Luxury, Quick, Repeat and Timer Balls; a Diamond core makes the Dream Ball."
	]
	quest.224692CBB768E5EB.title: "Ultra Prepared"
	quest.225BE4782837CE98.quest_desc: [
		"Pick a &eFrost Lily&r in the Frosted Caves and brew it into a &ePotion of Frost&r."
		""
		"Frost slows its target and deals damage over time."
	]
	quest.225BE4782837CE98.title: "Frozen Brew"
	quest.228BB8A8E3AD1E7D.quest_desc: [
		"&eTame&r an animal: a wolf, a cat, a parrot or a horse."
		""
		"Cats love raw &eCod&r and &eSalmon&r, so your catch of the day doubles as cat treats."
	]
	quest.228BB8A8E3AD1E7D.title: "Best Friends Forever"
	quest.22AF4206D217E2A2.quest_desc: [
		"&dCalyrex&r has lost its steed. Grow &eIceroot Carrots&r (seeds in igloo chests, planted on farmland in snowy biomes) or &eShaderoot Carrots&r (seeds in Thalic chests, planted on Thalic Farmland)."
		""
		"Offer a carrot at the Steed Pedestal in the &bCrown Shrine&r on the tundra: Iceroot calls &dGlastrier&r, Shaderoot calls &dSpectrier&r. Carry seeds and the Arc Phone tracks the shrine."
	]
	quest.22AF4206D217E2A2.title: "Royal Carrots"
	quest.22CE0A34A0527388.quest_desc: [
		"Get a &eLucky Egg&r: its holder earns more experience in battle."
		""
		"It cannot be crafted. &eChansey&r, &eBlissey&r and the &eTogepi&r family sometimes drop one when knocked out."
	]
	quest.22CE0A34A0527388.title: "Eggstra Experience"
	quest.22D8C6702353CA95.quest_desc: ["&eQualot Berry&r + Hearty Grains + Honey. Raises &eDefense&r EVs by 4 per Mochi."]
	quest.22D8C6702353CA95.title: "Resist Mochi"
	quest.22E2E964F76AE143.quest_desc: ["The &bFirescourge Shrine&r hides in Nether Wastes. With the power of 8 matching stakes it releases &dChi-Yu&r."]
	quest.22E2E964F76AE143.title: "Embers of Ruin"
	quest.230C1B67B2D4C58D.quest_desc: [
		"&eTrainer Brendan&r is the last test before the League. He waits on the plains, in open country and in caves."
		""
		"Attack Deoxys, Jirachi, Landorus, Galarian Zapdos, Huntail and Sceptile. Beat him and the Elite Four will see you."
	]
	quest.230C1B67B2D4C58D.quest_subtitle: "Trainer Brendan, final team"
	quest.230C1B67B2D4C58D.title: "Are You Prepared?"
	quest.2314B4745D80CC48.quest_desc: [
		"The &eBasic to Gold&r upgrade surrounded by &e8 Diamonds&r."
		""
		"Upgrades a placed basic chest or barrel straight to this tier, contents kept."
	]
	quest.2314B4745D80CC48.title: "Basic to Diamond Tier Upgrade"
	quest.231FC85C72C656AA.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e6,000 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"Evolves Phony Sinistea into Polteageist"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.231FC85C72C656AA.quest_subtitle: "6,000 CD"
	quest.231FC85C72C656AA.title: "Cracked Pot"
	quest.23538B82370B1565.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e300 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"Holder cures itself if it is paralyzed"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.23538B82370B1565.quest_subtitle: "300 CD"
	quest.23538B82370B1565.title: "Cheri Berry"
	quest.2381558C2B6A57A4.quest_desc: [
		"Mine &eRedstone Ore&r below y=16 with an iron pickaxe. The &eHealing Machine&r needs redstone."
		""
		"&aPokémon tip:&r the rare Rotom likes to appear near redstone gadgets, redstone ore, PCs and Healing Machines."
	]
	quest.2381558C2B6A57A4.title: "Red Dust"
	quest.2396985200DB7AB2.quest_desc: [
		"&e8 Gold Ingots&r around an &eIron Backpack&r."
		""
		"&e81 slots&r and &e3 upgrade slots&r."
	]
	quest.2396985200DB7AB2.title: "Gold Backpack"
	quest.239944B1E17A0EFB.quest_desc: [
		"&eElite Four Lance&r waits in the &eKanto League&r, a grand hall on the outer islands of the &5End&r (End Highlands and Midlands). Search for it with the compass."
		""
		"League team: Aerodactyl, Dracovish, Melmetal, Dragonite, Dialga and Salamence."
		""
		"He also wanders mountains and peaks, sometimes with a different team. Either team counts, and the Elite Four can be fought in any order."
	]
	quest.239944B1E17A0EFB.quest_subtitle: "Elite Four Lance"
	quest.239944B1E17A0EFB.title: "Dragon Master"
	quest.23AC25E6680452AA.quest_desc: [
		"&eRaid Dens&r are glowing crystals that shoot a beam of light into the sky. The brighter the beam, the higher the tier."
		""
		"They generate across the Overworld and also turn up in the Nether and the End. &eRight-click&r an active den to start a raid, or ask to join one that is running."
		""
		"Join any raid to begin."
	]
	quest.23AC25E6680452AA.quest_subtitle: "Join your first raid"
	quest.23AC25E6680452AA.title: "&6Crystal Calling"
	quest.23C578BCA0335390.quest_desc: [
		"Catch a &bVivillon&r."
		""
		"Its wing pattern depends on where it spawns: &eSandstorm&r in deserts, &ePolar&r over frozen oceans, &eArchipelago&r on mushroom islands, &eFancy&r in cherry groves, &eModern&r almost anywhere."
	]
	quest.23C578BCA0335390.title: "Wings of the World"
	quest.23C5C33ECF095CB4.quest_desc: [
		"Brush a pottery sherd out of a suspicious block."
		""
		"Desert wells, ocean ruins, trail ruins and Terralith's desert outposts and ruins all hide suspicious blocks."
	]
	quest.23C5C33ECF095CB4.title: "Brushed Up"
	quest.23D0BA1CA404EC1F.quest_desc: [
		"Catch (or evolve) a Pokémon you can ride on land."
		""
		"Good first mounts: &eRhyhorn&r, &eSkiddo&r, &eTauros&r, &eMudsdale&r, &eArcanine&r or &eCyclizar&r."
	]
	quest.23D0BA1CA404EC1F.title: "Trusty Steed"
	quest.23F5C282669B2392.quest_desc: [
		"&eGolden Apple&r, &eGolden Carrot&r, &eGlistering Melon Slice&r and an &eEnder Pearl&r around an &eUpgrade Base&r."
		""
		"Feeds you from the backpack's food when you get hungry. No more starving mid-hunt for a shiny."
	]
	quest.23F5C282669B2392.title: "Feeding Upgrade"
	quest.23FF05101B96A9A2.quest_desc: [
		"Harvest &e16 Wheat&r. Fully grown wheat turns golden and drops extra seeds."
		""
		"&aPokémon tie-in:&r a &ePasture Block&r needs two Wheat, and cows, sheep and goats all follow and breed with it."
	]
	quest.23FF05101B96A9A2.title: "Amber Waves"
	quest.240D367845CD97D6.quest_desc: [
		"Surround the previous Heal Upgrade with &e4 Blocks of Gold&r."
		""
		"Cuts the recharge time by &e40%&r: about &e90 seconds&r between heals."
	]
	quest.240D367845CD97D6.title: "Heal Upgrade Tier 2"
	quest.242205A05DAD6782.quest_desc: [
		"The Overworld is rebuilt with &eTerralith&r biomes, &eCTOV&r villages, &eYUNG's&r dungeons, temples and strongholds, &eExplorify&r structures and more."
		""
		"Look out for wandering &etrainers&r to battle, the eight &eKanto gyms&r, &eLegendary Monuments&r shrines and &eMega Showdown&r sites. Structure chests hold Cobblemon items, and with &eLootr&r every player gets their own loot."
		""
		"&aThe Exploration chapters track biomes, structures and treasure.&r"
	]
	quest.242205A05DAD6782.title: "A World Worth Exploring"
	quest.246A557069F7D0F6.quest_desc: [
		"Register &e100&r species as &eCaught&r in your Pokédex."
		""
		"A hundred species. Time to think about where the rest are hiding."
	]
	quest.246A557069F7D0F6.title: "Century of Species"
	quest.24970A9A65A77492.quest_desc: [
		"A &eGlass Bottle&r and one wild Berry, in the pot or a Brewing Stand, cure one status each:"
		"&ePecha&r: Antidote. &eChesto&r: Awakening. &eRawst&r: Burn Heal."
		"&eAspear&r: Ice Heal. &eCheri&r: Paralyze Heal."
	]
	quest.24970A9A65A77492.title: "House Call"
	quest.24978B60893E76E4.quest_desc: [
		"Every Pokémon can hold one item. Send it out with &eR&r, then sneak and right-click it to open the interaction wheel and choose &eChange held item&r."
		""
		"&aOnly Berries, Herbs and Type Gems are used up for good in battle; every other held item comes back afterwards.&r"
	]
	quest.24978B60893E76E4.title: "Hold It Right There"
	quest.24A1564B7A5D3916.quest_desc: ["Brush a &ePrize Pottery Sherd&r out of a Terralith desert outpost, which also has Archer, Miner and Skull."]
	quest.24A1564B7A5D3916.title: "Prize Sherd"
	quest.24B1C8A577EBA1A3.quest_desc: [
		"&eGalarica Nut&r bushes grow wild on sandy and dirt ground, and only bear well in Autumn."
		""
		"&aPokémon tie-in:&r nuts craft the &eGalarica Cuff&r and &eGalarica Wreath&r, which evolve Galarian Slowpoke."
	]
	quest.24B1C8A577EBA1A3.title: "Galarica Gathering"
	quest.24C29F7157895802.quest_desc: [
		"Craft a &eWatering Can&r from a Botanist's Workbench and a Bucket."
		""
		"Use it to open the Botanist's Workbench menu wherever you are."
	]
	quest.24C29F7157895802.title: "Watering Can"
	quest.24D8768FCD86D99A.quest_desc: [
		"Iron ore shows up everywhere below y=72, is densest around y=16 and forms huge veins high inside mountains."
		""
		"Pack 9 raw iron into a &eBlock of Raw Iron&r."
	]
	quest.24D8768FCD86D99A.title: "Iron Haul"
	quest.24E819148DAB3A90.quest_desc: [
		"The &ePoké Cake&r is the sugar cousin of the Poké Snack: 3 &eMilk&r, 2 &eSugar&r, a &eVivichoke&r and 3 &eHearty Grains&r."
		""
		"A placeable cake: season it with Berries to color it."
	]
	quest.24E819148DAB3A90.title: "Let Them Eat Cake"
	quest.24FCF127EDA6A93E.quest_desc: [
		"Cobblemon adds an ore for every evolution stone. Each one only generates under certain biomes, from deep underground up into the hills."
		""
		"Mine it with an &eiron pickaxe&r to get the stone itself (Fortune gives more). With Silk Touch you get the ore block, which smelts into the stone."
		""
		"Look at the &eregular stone variant&r of each ore to complete its quest: the deepslate, dripstone and terracotta versions do not count. The Evolution chapter covers what every stone does."
	]
	quest.24FCF127EDA6A93E.title: "Evolution Stone Ores"
	quest.252357DB6D466512.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e100 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"Increases a Pokémon's experience by 100 Exp. Points"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.252357DB6D466512.quest_subtitle: "100 CD"
	quest.252357DB6D466512.title: "Exp. Candy XS"
	quest.2539EBA6BCDEF7FE.quest_desc: [
		"The speed king: &e4 Netherite Ingots&r in the corners, &e3 Magma Cream&r on the top and side edges, &eSoul Sand&r or &eSoul Soil&r in the bottom middle, and your &eObsidian Furnace&r in the centre."
		""
		"Cook time: &e5 ticks&r per item. Nothing in this pack smelts faster."
	]
	quest.2539EBA6BCDEF7FE.title: "Netherite Furnace"
	quest.254FA3519FEEA12E.quest_desc: [
		"Finish &aTrainer Life&r: Berries and Apricorns, Cooking and Medicine, Fishing, Fossils and Geology, CobbleDollars and Gacha, and Pokéblocks and Decor."
		""
		"Farmer, cook, angler, fossil hunter and collector: a trainer's life is more than battles."
		""
		"&aUnlocks once every listed chapter finale is complete; then tick the checkmark.&r"
	]
	quest.254FA3519FEEA12E.title: "Life of a Ranger"
	quest.256028AFD741AE51.quest_desc: [
		"Smelt Chorus Fruit into &ePopped Chorus Fruit&r."
		""
		"It is the base of &ePurpur&r blocks and &eEnd Rods&r."
	]
	quest.256028AFD741AE51.title: "Popcorn of the Void"
	quest.2571CA0E265BB7F7.quest_desc: [
		"Win an &eEevee Pokédoll&r (the normal one) from the Plush-O-Matic with Plain Yarn."
		""
		"Odds: about 1 pull in 13, and every pull costs Yarn, so stock up on Type Gems first."
	]
	quest.2571CA0E265BB7F7.title: "Plush Eevee"
	quest.2576324432A57B62.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e150 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.2576324432A57B62.quest_subtitle: "150 CD"
	quest.2576324432A57B62.title: "Yellow Apricorn"
	quest.2583307B67911321.quest_desc: ["Blow the Newmoon Whistle and &dDarkrai&r answers. It works once, so be ready for a fight."]
	quest.2583307B67911321.title: "Pitch Black"
	quest.258ECAF42D10C5C0.quest_desc: [
		"Four Popped Chorus Fruit craft four &ePurpur Blocks&r, the stone End Cities are built from."
		""
		"Purpur also comes as pillars, stairs and slabs."
	]
	quest.258ECAF42D10C5C0.title: "Purple Palace"
	quest.259326A5F933988A.quest_desc: [
		"One Blaze Rod grinds into two &eBlaze Powder&r."
		""
		"It fuels the Brewing Stand and goes into &eEyes of Ender&r, Magma Cream and Fire Charges. Cobblemon uses it for the &eFocus Sash&r, &eExpert Belt&r, &eFlame Orb&r and &eRich Mulch&r."
	]
	quest.259326A5F933988A.title: "Spice of the Nether"
	quest.25A9005B2C8A8524.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e400 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"1× catch rate"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.25A9005B2C8A8524.quest_subtitle: "400 CD"
	quest.25A9005B2C8A8524.title: "Ancient Poké Ball"
	quest.25C8C2F2C3981750.quest_desc: ["Loot a Lootr &edecorated pot&r. Village and ruin pots can hold a per-player prize."]
	quest.25C8C2F2C3981750.title: "Pot Luck"
	quest.25F88A56CB89D747.quest_desc: [
		"Find an Explorify &ebadlands pyramid&r."
		""
		"&cSome of its chests are trapped.&r"
	]
	quest.25F88A56CB89D747.title: "Red Rock Pyramid"
	quest.25FBF87750E003B7.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e4,000 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.25FBF87750E003B7.quest_subtitle: "4,000 CD"
	quest.25FBF87750E003B7.title: "Lagging Tail"
	quest.2617A439090602B1.quest_desc: [
		"You have conquered the fortress, the bastion and the lava sea, and you wear netherite to prove it."
		""
		"Next: Blaze Powder and Ender Pearls make Eyes of Ender. &eThe End&r is waiting."
	]
	quest.2617A439090602B1.title: "&cMaster of the Nether"
	quest.261D2E9483E90EA4.quest_desc: [
		"Write a &eLove Letter&r: Paper plus three essences."
		"&eEssence of Love&r: sometimes when you breed animals. &eEssence of Friendship&r: when a Pokémon's friendship grows. &eEssence of Altruism&r: when you cure a zombie villager."
	]
	quest.261D2E9483E90EA4.title: "Signed, Sealed, Delivered"
	quest.2621EC3831690B36.quest_desc: [
		"The stat-boosting pinch Berries sit deep in the mutation tree: &eLiechi&r (Kelpsy + Pamtre), &eGanlon&r (Qualot + Watmel), &eSalac&r (Spelon + Tamato), &ePetaya&r (Durin + Hondew), &eApicot&r (Belue + Grepa)."
		""
		"The chains start from your Flavor Fusion Berries: Wiki + Bluk gives Cornn, then Cornn + Rindo gives Kelpsy."
		""
		"Each raises a stat by one stage when the holder is at a quarter of its HP."
	]
	quest.2621EC3831690B36.title: "Pinch Hitters"
	quest.262B006CF523F9D8.quest_desc: [
		"Redstone ore sits below y=16 and gets more common toward the bottom of the world."
		""
		"&aPokémon tip:&r Klink gather around redstone ore in dark caves."
	]
	quest.262B006CF523F9D8.title: "Deep Red"
	quest.263DF7F72D2039F5.quest_desc: [
		"Bottle it during the fight: hold out a &eGlass Bottle&r in the purple cloud the dragon breathes to collect &eDragon's Breath&r."
		""
		"It turns potions into lingering ones, and in a Brewing Stand it brews a &eMedicinal Brew&r into an &eAbility Capsule&r for your Pokémon."
	]
	quest.263DF7F72D2039F5.title: "Bottled Fury"
	quest.265AEEE7E0DCB554.quest_desc: [
		"&eDrowned&r lurk in oceans and rivers. Some carry a Trident, and only those can drop one."
		""
		"Kill 10. When you kill them they can also drop &eCopper Ingots&r."
	]
	quest.265AEEE7E0DCB554.title: "Something in the Water"
	quest.26B559F947ABB44D.quest_desc: [
		"Iron ingots, &eIron Bars&r and wooden slabs. A &eCage&r catches animals the same way a jar does, but bigger ones: rabbits, chickens, foxes, parrots and more. Tameable animals must be tamed first."
		""
		"&aNote:&r cages are for ordinary animals. Your Pokémon belong in Poké Balls."
	]
	quest.26B559F947ABB44D.title: "Animal Carrier"
	quest.26D8BB257BC50AF7.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e150 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.26D8BB257BC50AF7.quest_subtitle: "150 CD"
	quest.26D8BB257BC50AF7.title: "Pink Apricorn"
	quest.26FF0C4DD894E24E.quest_desc: ["Craft an &eApricorn Boat&r from 5 Apricorn Planks."]
	quest.26FF0C4DD894E24E.title: "Set Sail"
	quest.270372F132CFA0EF.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e4,000 CobbleDollars&r for 10."
		""
		"1× catch rate"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.270372F132CFA0EF.quest_subtitle: "4,000 CD"
	quest.270372F132CFA0EF.title: "Poké Ball x10"
	quest.2733B89601C95A15.quest_desc: [
		"Register &e200&r species as &eCaught&r in your Pokédex."
		""
		"Check the region quests below to see which parts of the world you have missed."
	]
	quest.2733B89601C95A15.title: "Dex Devotee"
	quest.273EC730541B9A53.quest_desc: ["Right-click your &eGlobe&r again and again until it spins at ludicrous speed."]
	quest.273EC730541B9A53.title: "You Spin Me Right Round"
	quest.275EA8D438B8DE54.quest_desc: [
		"The Wither, the Warden, the Elder Guardian and the Pharaoh have all fallen to you."
		""
		"Take this &eEnchanted Golden Apple&r: eating one gives strong Regeneration, Absorption, Resistance and Fire Resistance for your next big fight."
	]
	quest.275EA8D438B8DE54.title: "&cMaster Monster Hunter"
	quest.2790ED1A33745FD3.quest_desc: ["Grow a &ePitcher Plant&r from a &ePitcher Pod&r, the Sniffer's other find."]
	quest.2790ED1A33745FD3.title: "Pitcher Perfect"
	quest.2798D3A19AC6B7E0.quest_desc: [
		"Four gold ingots around redstone make a &eClock&r."
		""
		"&aPokémon tip:&r many Pokémon keep a schedule, so check the time before a hunt."
		"Wrap a clock in eight paper for a Serene Seasons &eCalendar&r."
	]
	quest.2798D3A19AC6B7E0.title: "Time Keeper"
	quest.27A01D6AA7113A5B.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e400 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"Thaws out a Pokémon that has been frozen solid"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.27A01D6AA7113A5B.quest_subtitle: "400 CD"
	quest.27A01D6AA7113A5B.title: "Ice Heal"
	quest.27DF0F5848A5AB49.quest_desc: [
		"Find an upgraded monster room from &eYUNG's Better Dungeons&r."
		""
		"They replace the old cobblestone dungeons, and Cobblemon Loot Plus mixes Cobblemon items into their loot."
	]
	quest.27DF0F5848A5AB49.title: "Quite the Renovation"
	quest.27E0EAF53E57B456.quest_desc: [
		"&6Tier two.&r An &eIron Ingot&r core makes the Great Ball and eleven specialty balls: Dive, Fast, Friend, Heavy, Level, Lure, Moon, Nest, Net, Park and Sport."
		""
		"Have 4 Iron Ingots ready to start crafting."
	]
	quest.27E0EAF53E57B456.title: "Iron Core"
	quest.281148B115D121D7.quest_desc: [
		"Revive &e5&r Fossil Pokémon."
		""
		"Duplicates are welcome: every revive counts."
	]
	quest.281148B115D121D7.title: "Fossil Fan"
	quest.2815817EE41BC927.quest_desc: [
		"Mega Evolve &e25&r times."
		""
		"Try a different Mega now and then: every stone changes how a Pokémon fights."
	]
	quest.2815817EE41BC927.title: "Mega Regular"
	quest.2816D95F585109F3.quest_desc: [
		"Find an Explorify &edark forest settlement&r."
		""
		"A gloomy hamlet deep in the Dark Forest; Cobblemon Loot Plus adds Cobblemon items to its chests."
	]
	quest.2816D95F585109F3.title: "Hidden Hamlet"
	quest.283BB5BB6B2B69C9.quest_desc: [
		"Six Planks and three Honeycomb build a &eBeehive&r."
		""
		"Place it near flowers, lead bees to it with flowers in hand, and you have a honey farm next to your fields."
	]
	quest.283BB5BB6B2B69C9.title: "Home Sweet Hive"
	quest.283F5974B3850015.quest_desc: ["Dynamax &e25&r times."]
	quest.283F5974B3850015.title: "Skyscraper"
	quest.2840B814E9098592.quest_desc: [
		"Seven &eGlass&r and a wooden slab make a &eJar&r."
		""
		"Jars hold liquids from bottles, buckets and bowls, stacks of cookies, and small creatures such as bees, slimes and frogs: use an empty jar on one to catch it."
	]
	quest.2840B814E9098592.title: "Message in a Jar"
	quest.28666078FA967721.quest_desc: [
		"Each urn takes 4 Bricks, 2 Gunpowder and a Netherite Scrap around a stone: Ice Stone for &eFrost&r, Thunder Stone for &eStorms&r, Fire Stone for &eEmbers&r."
		""
		"Charge an urn by defeating 50 Pokémon of its type (the tooltip tracks progress), then right-click to release it."
	]
	quest.28666078FA967721.title: "Three Urns, Three Storms"
	quest.2870E04B3A0AB5B3.quest_desc: [
		"&6Effort Values (EVs)&r are bonus stat points earned through training. Every Pokémon your battler knocks out adds EVs to the stats that species is known for."
		""
		"Check them on the &eStats&r page of the summary (&eC&r)."
		"Boost them with &eVitamins&r (+10), &ePower items&r (+8 per battle) and Mochi from the Campfire Pot (+4)."
	]
	quest.2870E04B3A0AB5B3.title: "Effort Values"
	quest.2874A84493410DD2.quest_desc: [
		"A silent trainer has been watching. &eTrainer Red&r appears in &erare biomes&r and near &5End Cities&r once you are Champion."
		""
		"Pikachu, Venusaur, Blastoise, Charizard, Snorlax and Mewtwo, every one at level 100. The hardest battle in Kanto."
	]
	quest.2874A84493410DD2.quest_subtitle: "Trainer Red"
	quest.2874A84493410DD2.title: "Kanto Legend"
	quest.287B6009773A32D9.quest_desc: [
		"Your melee hits deal 4 extra damage."
		""
		"&6Where to look:&r Pillager Outposts, Ruined Portals, big Ocean Ruins."
	]
	quest.287B6009773A32D9.title: "Power Glove"
	quest.287F54EFE2A37060.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e1,000 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"2.5× in all Forest or Plains biomes"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.287F54EFE2A37060.quest_subtitle: "1,000 CD"
	quest.287F54EFE2A37060.title: "Park Ball"
	quest.289749F27B462857.quest_desc: [
		"An &eAdvanced Pump Upgrade&r with &eRedstone&r, &e2 Eyes of Ender&r and &e2 Bottles o' Enchanting&r."
		""
		"Pumps experience between your Tank Upgrade and you. Bank levels before a risky trip."
	]
	quest.289749F27B462857.title: "Experience Pump Upgrade"
	quest.28B8805DB3022115.quest_desc: [
		"Open &eSystem Upgrades&r on the Arc Phone and buy an app. Each costs the Cobblemon &eUpgrade&r item plus one matching item, both consumed on purchase:"
		"&ePC&r app: a PC. &ePokédex&r app: a Pokédex. &eHeal&r app: a Healing Machine. &eEnder Chest&r app: an Ender Chest."
	]
	quest.28B8805DB3022115.title: "Factory Reset Not Included"
	quest.28C9545D46C9B0F6.quest_desc: [
		"Find a &eBetter Witch Hut&r in a swamp."
		""
		"Knock first. Witches do not like visitors."
	]
	quest.28C9545D46C9B0F6.title: "Something Wicked"
	quest.28CD8FCB459DBFD7.quest_desc: [
		"Register &e600&r species as &eCaught&r."
		""
		"Around 880 non-legendary species roam this world. You have met most of them."
	]
	quest.28CD8FCB459DBFD7.title: "Living Encyclopedia"
	quest.29166899C89BFEB7.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e6,000 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"Burns the holder"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.29166899C89BFEB7.quest_subtitle: "6,000 CD"
	quest.29166899C89BFEB7.title: "Flame Orb"
	quest.291A3D5612AD9A43.quest_desc: [
		"The &eN-Solarizer&r fuses Necrozma with Solgaleo; the &eN-Lunarizer&r does the same with Lunala."
		""
		"Recipe: six Iron Ingots, Orange Wool, a Sun Stone and Redstone (the Lunarizer swaps in Light Blue Wool and a Moon Stone)."
	]
	quest.291A3D5612AD9A43.title: "Sun Fusion"
	quest.29463B6B40AC91DE.quest_desc: [
		"You are a trainer now. This chapter tracks the long road to &6Champion of Origins&r."
		""
		"Each of the seven honours on the arc unlocks when you finish the finales (octagons) of one set of chapters. Earn all seven to claim the crown."
		""
		"&aTake your time: the chapters can be finished in any order.&r"
	]
	quest.29463B6B40AC91DE.quest_subtitle: "The last chapter"
	quest.29463B6B40AC91DE.title: "The Road to Champion"
	quest.29527037BD1C45F5.quest_desc: [
		"Double jump!"
		""
		"&6Where to look:&r mineshaft chests, End City chests, Pillager Outposts, big Ocean Ruins, brushing Trail Ruins."
	]
	quest.29527037BD1C45F5.title: "Cloud in a Bottle"
	quest.296257C8860BE0CB.quest_desc: [
		"Catch a Pokémon with a &eLure Ball&r."
		""
		"&aFish a Pokémon up with a Poké Rod (Fishing chapter), then throw.&r"
	]
	quest.296257C8860BE0CB.title: "Hooked"
	quest.2978DBCC2E268275.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e3,000 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"Evolves certain Pokémon"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.2978DBCC2E268275.quest_subtitle: "3,000 CD"
	quest.2978DBCC2E268275.title: "Dawn Stone"
	quest.298665F54F62A2EB.quest_desc: [
		"Brew a &7Potion of Weakness&r: a Water Bottle plus a Fermented Spider Eye. No Nether Wart needed."
		""
		"Weakness is the first step of curing a zombie villager (Villagers and Raids)."
	]
	quest.298665F54F62A2EB.title: "Feeling Weak"
	quest.29942D21BD84B535.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e1,000 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"2×, throws less far"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.29942D21BD84B535.quest_subtitle: "1,000 CD"
	quest.29942D21BD84B535.title: "Ancient Gigaton Ball"
	quest.299DB592F578772C.quest_desc: [
		"&eStonecutter&r, &eIron&r and &eRedstone&r around an &eUpgrade Base&r."
		""
		"A stonecutter in an upgrade tab, for builders on the move."
	]
	quest.299DB592F578772C.title: "Stonecutter Upgrade"
	quest.29A9967D884CCE2F.quest_desc: ["Find a Terralith &egiant bee hive&r underground, in Lush Caves or an Underground Jungle."]
	quest.29A9967D884CCE2F.title: "Buzzing Below"
	quest.29D14D266746F077.quest_desc: [
		"Craft a &eMetal Coat&r: six Iron Ingots around a Clay Ball, a Steel Gem and a Honeycomb."
		""
		"Some trade evolutions only work while the Pokémon holds the right item."
	]
	quest.29D14D266746F077.title: "Coated in Metal"
	quest.29DD796F386A68CC.quest_desc: [
		"&eLeader Brock&r waits in the &ePewter Gym&r, high in &emeadows&r, &ehighlands&r, &ewindswept hills&r and rocky peaks and cliffs such as &eStony Peaks&r, &eEmerald Peaks&r and &eGranite Cliffs&r."
		""
		"He fields Alolan Geodude, Vulpix, Onix and Archen, all around level 13. Water moves wash his whole team away."
		""
		"&aBrock is the first gym: he battles anyone.&r"
	]
	quest.29DD796F386A68CC.quest_subtitle: "Leader Brock, Pewter Gym"
	quest.29DD796F386A68CC.title: "Boulder Badge"
	quest.29E48A0C06D0607A.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e1,000 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"2× catch rate"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.29E48A0C06D0607A.quest_subtitle: "1,000 CD"
	quest.29E48A0C06D0607A.title: "Ultra Ball"
	quest.29EF4209F2552D0D.quest_desc: [
		"Iron, &eIron Bars&r and redstone. A &eWind Vane&r swings in the breeze and reacts to the weather."
		""
		"Its redstone output changes when rain or a storm rolls in, so you can wire it to close the shutters automatically."
	]
	quest.29EF4209F2552D0D.title: "Which Way the Wind Blows"
	quest.29F412290C0026E1.quest_desc: [
		"Mine iron ore and smelt the raw iron into an &eIron Ingot&r."
		""
		"&aPokémon tip:&r iron replaces copper in the &eGreat Ball&r recipe and goes into the Healing Machine, PC and Pokédex."
	]
	quest.29F412290C0026E1.title: "Iron Age"
	quest.29FA66CFC00630F1.quest_desc: [
		"You have revived fossils by the dozen, rebuilt Galar's patchwork Pokémon, grown Tumblestones and Type Gems and recovered techniques lost to time."
		""
		"Click the checkmark to claim your reward, Professor."
	]
	quest.29FA66CFC00630F1.title: "Master of the Ancient"
	quest.29FF4CDC3E0C8B78.quest_desc: [
		"Find a &eIce Stone Ore&r: it generates under glacial, snowy forest, snowy taiga and tundra biomes, more rarely under any freezing biome."
		"Look at the regular stone variant, found above the deepslate layer."
		""
		"&aPokémon tip:&r this stone evolves Pokémon such as Eevee, Crabrawler and Cetoddle."
	]
	quest.29FF4CDC3E0C8B78.title: "Ice Stone Ore"
	quest.2A06CC336C019084.quest_desc: [
		"Reach &6Bryce Canyon&r."
		""
		"Vullaby and Mandibuzz circle under the open sky, and Klawf clings to the rock."
	]
	quest.2A06CC336C019084.title: "Canyon Echoes"
	quest.2A09387C4C0249F0.quest_desc: [
		"Find the &6Skylands (Summer)&r, floating islands high in the sky."
		""
		"Drampa spawns here above Y 190, which makes these islands a perfect perch."
		"&oAn ultra-rare Salamence may circle overhead.&r"
	]
	quest.2A09387C4C0249F0.title: "Head in the Clouds"
	quest.2A27D994268849F3.quest_desc: [
		"The world is full of buildings worth looting, and some Pokémon only live in or around them."
		""
		"Craft an &eExplorer's Compass&r: a &eCompass&r ringed by four &eCobwebs&r (cut them with Shears) and four &eCracked Stone Bricks&r (smelt Stone Bricks)."
		"Pick a structure and it points the way, with coordinates on screen. Searches are free and it never breaks."
		"&aLootr is installed: every chest has its own loot for each player.&r"
	]
	quest.2A27D994268849F3.title: "Explorer's Compass"
	quest.2A3E428CEABD40E0.quest_desc: [
		"Craft a &ePoké Gacha Coin&r from a Relic Coin and Red Dye."
		""
		"Every machine that takes Relic Coins also takes any &eGacha Coin&r, one coin per pull, and the Bank buys them back for 50."
	]
	quest.2A3E428CEABD40E0.title: "Commemorative Coin"
	quest.2A4991DD724B48B4.quest_desc: [
		"Craft a &eFossil Analyzer&r from Cobbled Deepslate, an Amethyst Shard, Iron Ingots, Glass and Redstone Dust."
		""
		"It reads the fossil you insert. It holds up to &e2&r fossils at once, which matters for the Galar fossils."
	]
	quest.2A4991DD724B48B4.title: "Fossil Analyzer"
	quest.2A51B3E97A75AE1F.quest_desc: [
		"Craft a &eRespawn Anchor&r from six Crying Obsidian and three Glowstone."
		""
		"Charge it with Glowstone and it sets your respawn point in the Nether. Beds explode here, so this is how you camp in the Nether."
		"&cWarning:&r used in the Overworld, it explodes."
	]
	quest.2A51B3E97A75AE1F.title: "Home Away From Home"
	quest.2A51F86071FDD314.quest_desc: [
		"&aKlink&r spawn far more often in dark caves next to redstone ore than anywhere else."
		""
		"Catch a Klink."
	]
	quest.2A51F86071FDD314.title: "Clockwork Critter"
	quest.2A5201646E03F41E.quest_desc: [
		"&ePiston&r, &eIron&r, &eRedstone&r and a &eChest&r around an &eUpgrade Base&r."
		""
		"The reverse of Restock: sneak and right-click a chest with the backpack to unload into it."
	]
	quest.2A5201646E03F41E.title: "Deposit Upgrade"
	quest.2A5AAE9D3A540392.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat a &etier 1&r raid boss."
		""
		"Tier 1 bosses are level &e12&r with 5x their normal HP. A win pays &e1,500&r CobbleDollars and the reward Pokémon comes with no guaranteed perfect IVs."
	]
	quest.2A5AAE9D3A540392.quest_subtitle: "Tier 1 raid"
	quest.2A5AAE9D3A540392.title: "One-Star Wonder"
	quest.2A69628C559650DC.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e5,000 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"Boosts the power of the holder's Poison-type moves"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.2A69628C559650DC.quest_subtitle: "5,000 CD"
	quest.2A69628C559650DC.title: "Poison Barb"
	quest.2A6F4826F72597D9.quest_desc: [
		"Creepers avoid you and attacking Phantoms get hissed at."
		""
		"&6Where to look:&r buried treasure, village tanneries."
	]
	quest.2A6F4826F72597D9.title: "Kitty Slippers"
	quest.2A907EFFA6459A2C.quest_desc: [
		"Collect 8 &eBottles o' Enchanting&r. Throw one and it bursts into experience orbs."
		""
		"&eCleric&r villagers trade them, and they turn up in pillager outpost and dungeon chests."
		"&aEnchanting and anvil jobs both cost levels, so keep a stack handy.&r"
	]
	quest.2A907EFFA6459A2C.title: "Bottled Wisdom"
	quest.2ABD697584C34CBD.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e10,000 CobbleDollars&r for 10."
		""
		"2× catch rate"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.2ABD697584C34CBD.quest_subtitle: "10,000 CD"
	quest.2ABD697584C34CBD.title: "Ultra Ball x10"
	quest.2AC19A2640399CF5.quest_desc: [
		"More held items for trading: Rhydon with a Protector, Electabuzz with an Electirizer, Magmar with a Magmarizer, Dusclops with a Reaper Cloth, Seadra with a Dragon Scale, Feebas with a Prism Scale, Clamperl with a Deep Sea Tooth or Scale, Spritzee with a Sachet and Swirlix with a Whipped Dream."
		""
		"&aTip:&r the recipe viewer shows the craftable ones. The scales and the Deep Sea Tooth turn up as Poké Rod treasure."
	]
	quest.2AC19A2640399CF5.title: "Trade Secrets"
	quest.2AC1A1207F7FB7E1.quest_desc: [
		"Exp. All is &coff&r in this pack, so the &eExp. Share&r is how benched Pokémon keep up: the holder gets 50% of the battle EXP without fighting."
		""
		"Recipe: 2 &eAmethyst Shards&r, a &eGold Ingot&r, 2 &eLapis&r, an &eIron Helmet&r and 2 &eIron Ingots&r. Give it to a Pokémon through its held item menu."
	]
	quest.2AC1A1207F7FB7E1.title: "Sharing Is Caring"
	quest.2ACD7AD52F0A7418.quest_desc: ["Use a &eWater Stone&r on Eevee."]
	quest.2ACD7AD52F0A7418.title: "Vaporeon"
	quest.2AD27A7FBA361EEA.quest_desc: [
		"Catch a &eCubchoo&r."
		""
		"Look on the &6Frozen Cliffs&r, ideally while it is snowing: lone Cubchoo only spawn in snowfall."
	]
	quest.2AD27A7FBA361EEA.title: "Runny Nose"
	quest.2ADDE22924335BB2.quest_desc: [
		"Brew a &eVivichoke&r into a &eHyper Potion&r for a &eMax Potion&r: full HP."
		""
		"&cBrewing Stand only:&r the Campfire Pot has no recipe for it."
	]
	quest.2ADDE22924335BB2.title: "To the Max"
	quest.2AE77081B21F3BEE.quest_desc: [
		"Find a &eMoon Stone&r."
		""
		"&6Ore:&r taigas, snowy taigas, mushroom fields and dripstone caves (Dripstone Moon Stone Ore sits inside dripstone), rarer in dark forests."
		"&6Evolves:&r Clefairy, Jigglypuff, Nidorina, Nidorino, Skitty and Munna."
	]
	quest.2AE77081B21F3BEE.title: "Moonstruck"
	quest.2AE9CAE04B036030.quest_desc: [
		"Find a ruined &eGimmighoul tower&r."
		""
		"There are six styles, from frozen to sunscorched, each with chests on the way up."
		"Gimmighoul count these as ruins too, so keep an eye out for coins with legs."
	]
	quest.2AE9CAE04B036030.title: "Tower of Treasure"
	quest.2B0926D8C215E8D7.quest_desc: ["Brew a PP Up with a &eKelpsy Berry&r to make &eProtein&r. Each one adds 10 Attack EVs."]
	quest.2B0926D8C215E8D7.title: "Protein"
	quest.2B11426E2BC62174.quest_desc: [
		"Bees sting when you rob them. Place a &eCampfire&r under the nest first: the smoke keeps them calm."
		""
		"Then bottle the honey without making a single bee angry."
	]
	quest.2B11426E2BC62174.title: "Bee Our Guest"
	quest.2B204019CE2BD388.quest_desc: [
		"Use any &eMint&r on a Pokémon: its stats change to those of the Mint's nature."
		""
		"Natures shape every stat point, so fix a bad nature instead of releasing a Pokémon you love."
	]
	quest.2B204019CE2BD388.title: "Not a Big Commit-mint"
	quest.2B214B70939B1B22.quest_desc: [
		"&e6 Diamonds&r on the top and bottom rows, &e2 Glass&r on the sides, &eGolden Furnace&r in the middle."
		""
		"Cook time: &e80 ticks&r per item. Next comes the Emerald Furnace on the main line, with the Crystal Furnace as a side tier."
	]
	quest.2B214B70939B1B22.title: "Diamond Furnace"
	quest.2B3705B28ED00AF9.quest_desc: [
		"Catch one &6Rock&r, one &7Steel&r and one &bIce&r Pokémon."
		""
		"Rock shatters Ice, and Steel beats both while resisting their moves."
	]
	quest.2B3705B28ED00AF9.title: "Hard Cases"
	quest.2B56F6FB5CB7BC11.quest_desc: [
		"Only &e4 Iron Ingots&r around a &eCopper Backpack&r (or 8 around a leather one)."
		""
		"&e54 slots&r and a second &eupgrade slot&r."
	]
	quest.2B56F6FB5CB7BC11.title: "Iron Backpack"
	quest.2B5F162C62ACBCA1.quest_desc: ["Find a &eRib&r armor trim template in a Nether Fortress chest."]
	quest.2B5F162C62ACBCA1.title: "Rib Trim"
	quest.2B6D34D2C14660D2.quest_desc: ["Craft an &eAssault Vest&r: a Leather Chestplate, three Armadillo Scutes and two &eProtectors&r (Bricks, Armadillo Scutes and a Copper Ingot). A big Sp. Def boost, but no status moves."]
	quest.2B6D34D2C14660D2.title: "Armored Up"
	quest.2B75D24F57AA2E72.quest_desc: [
		"&eLeader Erika&r tends the &eCeladon Gym&r in &eforests&r, &ebirch forests&r, &eflower forests&r and green valleys such as &eBlooming Valley&r and &eLavender Valley&r."
		""
		"She is next right after Lt. Surge. Rillaboom, Serperior, Venusaur, Meganium and Hisuian Electrode all burn: bring Fire moves."
	]
	quest.2B75D24F57AA2E72.quest_subtitle: "Leader Erika, Celadon Gym"
	quest.2B75D24F57AA2E72.title: "Rainbow Badge"
	quest.2B81B77DB82AD84F.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e400 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"1×, throws less far"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.2B81B77DB82AD84F.quest_subtitle: "400 CD"
	quest.2B81B77DB82AD84F.title: "Ancient Heavy Ball"
	quest.2BA556E7DA9CBE36.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e500 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.2BA556E7DA9CBE36.quest_subtitle: "500 CD"
	quest.2BA556E7DA9CBE36.title: "Berry Juice"
	quest.2BB7CDA09AE229A6.quest_desc: ["Craft a &eMuscle Band&r: four Leather, two Gold Ingots and two Redstone. It boosts the holder's physical moves, and it is the core of the Choice Band."]
	quest.2BB7CDA09AE229A6.title: "Muscle Memory"
	quest.2BC002D57426E61F.quest_desc: [
		"The &eBasic to Diamond&r upgrade plus a &eNetherite Ingot&r."
		""
		"Upgrades a placed basic chest or barrel straight to this tier, contents kept."
	]
	quest.2BC002D57426E61F.title: "Basic to Netherite Tier Upgrade"
	quest.2BE0D1119BD04F55.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e5,000 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"Changes a Pokémon's stats to be that of a Lonely nature"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.2BE0D1119BD04F55.quest_subtitle: "5,000 CD"
	quest.2BE0D1119BD04F55.title: "Lonely Mint"
	quest.2BE287DBD350D75A.quest_desc: [
		"Craft a &eBookshelf&r from 6 Planks and 3 Books."
		""
		"Bookshelves near an Enchanting Table raise the level of its offers."
	]
	quest.2BE287DBD350D75A.title: "Shelf Life"
	quest.2BEDC02EA49ACB38.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat 25 wild &dFairy&r-type Pokémon in battle."
		""
		"&6Weak to:&r Poison, Steel"
		"&cResists:&r Bug, Dark, Fighting"
		"&cImmune to:&r Dragon"
	]
	quest.2BEDC02EA49ACB38.title: "Happily Ever After"
	quest.2BF6E97371B28645.quest_desc: [
		"Deal 50 hearts of damage in a single Mace hit."
		""
		"&aClimb high, jump, and swing just before you land.&r"
	]
	quest.2BF6E97371B28645.title: "Over-Overkill"
	quest.2C0674A142C47333.quest_desc: [
		"When you die, &eUniversal Graves&r stores your items and all of your experience in a grave where you fell. It never breaks on its own."
		""
		"You respawn with a compass pointing to the grave, and &e/back&r takes you there. Other players cannot open it for the first 15 minutes."
		""
		"&aSneak and use the grave to grab everything at once.&r"
	]
	quest.2C0674A142C47333.title: "Death Is Not the End"
	quest.2C10420F1935B4BA.quest_desc: ["Mega Evolve &e10&r times. Any Pokémon and any battle count."]
	quest.2C10420F1935B4BA.title: "Mega Habit"
	quest.2C16584D350E068A.quest_desc: [
		"Food that is never used up. Each bite has a 15 second cooldown."
		""
		"&6Where to look:&r village butchers, Bastion hoglin stables; very rarely from cows and mooshrooms you kill."
	]
	quest.2C16584D350E068A.title: "Everlasting Beef"
	quest.2C2946EB58E83100.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat &e250&r wild Pokémon."
		""
		"Knocking out a wild &eAlpha&r drops a reward bundle with EXP Candies and more. The bundle improves at levels 31, 51 and 66."
	]
	quest.2C2946EB58E83100.title: "Alpha Bonus"
	quest.2C38B7E574975FD1.quest_desc: [
		"Creatures you kill drop 50% more experience."
		""
		"&6Where to look:&r Bastion treasure rooms, buried treasure, shipwreck treasure; rarely worn by piglins."
	]
	quest.2C38B7E574975FD1.title: "Golden Hook"
	quest.2C8742C66592F862.quest_desc: [
		"Six planks and one iron ingot make a &eShield&r."
		""
		"Raise it to deflect arrows and other projectiles. Players cannot hurt Pokémon here, so your gear is strictly for monsters."
	]
	quest.2C8742C66592F862.title: "Hold the Line"
	quest.2C8C54C4B6F00DE5.quest_desc: [
		"&eBoss Giovanni&r returns, now in the &cNether&r as well as the badlands and savannas."
		""
		"Hippowdon, Excadrill, Kangaskhan, Garchomp and Polteageist. Win to open the road to Saffron."
	]
	quest.2C8C54C4B6F00DE5.quest_subtitle: "Boss Giovanni"
	quest.2C8C54C4B6F00DE5.title: "Fateful Encounter"
	quest.2CC53862644D01CF.quest_desc: [
		"Four iron ingots around redstone make a &eCompass&r."
		""
		"It is the base of the &ePokéFinder&r, &eNature's Compass&r, &eExplorer's Compass&r and the &eMega Site Compass&r."
	]
	quest.2CC53862644D01CF.title: "Find Your Way"
	quest.2CD753D5DD0B2185.quest_desc: [
		"&e/sethome [name]&r saves up to 3 homes and &e/home [name]&r takes you back. &e/spawn&r returns to world spawn, and &e/back&r to where you last teleported or died."
		""
		"&e/rtp&r drops you somewhere new, 500 to 25,000 blocks from spawn (10 minute cooldown, not in the End)."
		""
		"&aWaystones generate in villages and teleporting between activated ones is free. See Travel and Camping.&r"
	]
	quest.2CD753D5DD0B2185.title: "Homes and Fast Travel"
	quest.2CDC74AD15874BE5.quest_desc: [
		"Cook a &eSuspicious Stew&r (a bowl, a red and a brown mushroom and any small flower) and drink it."
		""
		"Each flower gives a different short effect. Some are better than others..."
	]
	quest.2CDC74AD15874BE5.title: "When the Stew is Sus"
	quest.2CE6BBF256D93D38.quest_desc: [
		"Craft all seven original Apricorn Balls: &eFast&r, &eLevel&r, &eLure&r, &eHeavy&r, &eLove&r, &eFriend&r and &eMoon&r."
		""
		"Six use an Iron core; the Love Ball needs Gold."
	]
	quest.2CE6BBF256D93D38.title: "Kurt Would Be Proud"
	quest.2CF251C6B6D4BE2E.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e6,000 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.2CF251C6B6D4BE2E.quest_subtitle: "6,000 CD"
	quest.2CF251C6B6D4BE2E.title: "Razor Claw"
	quest.2CFB006418EE9F92.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e2,000 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"Prevents the holder from evolving"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.2CFB006418EE9F92.quest_subtitle: "2,000 CD"
	quest.2CFB006418EE9F92.title: "Everstone"
	quest.2D2001F64B87689B.quest_desc: ["Craft the &eToolsmith&r's job site: 2 Iron Ingots over 4 Planks. It is also where armor trims and Netherite gear are made."]
	quest.2D2001F64B87689B.title: "Toolsmith"
	quest.2D4A9092EFF7ECD0.quest_desc: [
		"Dig past y=8 and stone gives way to &eDeepslate&r. Below y=0 it is deepslate all the way down."
		""
		"Cobbled deepslate works like cobblestone for tools and furnaces, and the &eFossil Analyzer&r needs it."
		"&aPokémon tip:&r Roggenrola and Alolan Diglett spawn in the dark below y=0."
	]
	quest.2D4A9092EFF7ECD0.title: "Below Zero"
	quest.2D5B81A2F2684286.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat 25 wild &3Flying&r-type Pokémon in battle."
		""
		"&6Weak to:&r Electric, Ice, Rock"
		"&cResists:&r Bug, Fighting, Grass"
		"&cImmune to:&r Ground"
	]
	quest.2D5B81A2F2684286.title: "Grounded"
	quest.2D70759B7AE95F7E.quest_desc: [
		"Surround a torch with eight &eIron Nuggets&r for a &eLantern&r."
		""
		"One iron ingot crafts into nine nuggets."
	]
	quest.2D70759B7AE95F7E.title: "Lantern Light"
	quest.2DC55AF7700A8256.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e2,000 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"Raises the Pokémon's Sp. Atk EVs by 4"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.2DC55AF7700A8256.quest_subtitle: "2,000 CD"
	quest.2DC55AF7700A8256.title: "Genius Mochi"
	quest.2DFB2BD431738EF4.quest_desc: [
		"Smelt &eAsh&r into &eAsh Bricks&r, then craft four into a block of Ash Bricks."
		""
		"A dark, sooty stone for chimneys and forges. Slabs, stairs and walls follow."
	]
	quest.2DFB2BD431738EF4.title: "Ash Masonry"
	quest.2DFF1E6F91AA3D08.quest_desc: [
		"&eCobbleDollars&r (CD) are the pack's currency. You earn them by beating wild Pokémon and NPC trainers, and from quest rewards."
		""
		"Spend them in the &3Poké Mart&r pages of this book, or at &eCobble Merchants&r in villages. A merchant's bank buys Relic Coins (50 CD), Pouches (475 CD), Sacks (4,500 CD) and Gacha Coins (50 CD), but not Emeralds."
		""
		"&aA Poké Ball costs 400 CD in the shop. More in CobbleDollars and Gacha.&r"
	]
	quest.2DFF1E6F91AA3D08.title: "Pocket Money"
	quest.2E058269493C574A.quest_desc: [
		"Revive an &eAerodactyl&r (Rock/Flying) from an &eOld Amber Fossil&r."
		""
		"Look for it at frozen ponds, lush dens and buried oak or spruce trees."
	]
	quest.2E058269493C574A.title: "Aerodactyl"
	quest.2E2C84DEB06BEA79.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e1,000 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.2E2C84DEB06BEA79.quest_subtitle: "1,000 CD"
	quest.2E2C84DEB06BEA79.title: "Hondew Berry"
	quest.2E3AB9AE1EA50D92.quest_desc: [
		"A full belly and a full larder: this chapter covers &efields&r, &elivestock&r, &ebees&r, &efishing&r and the &eseasons&r."
		""
		"Eat anything to begin. Then till some soil, raise a herd, keep bees and learn which crops grow in which season."
		""
		"&aYour farm feeds your Pokémon too: many crops season food in the Campfire Pot.&r"
	]
	quest.2E3AB9AE1EA50D92.title: "&lDown on the Farm"
	quest.2E6042A9CAE9BC14.quest_desc: [
		"Craft a &eBrush&r: a Feather, a Copper Ingot and a Stick, stacked."
		""
		"Hold right-click on &eSuspicious Sand&r or &eSuspicious Gravel&r to slowly uncover what is buried inside."
		"&cMining a suspicious block destroys its loot. Always brush.&r"
	]
	quest.2E6042A9CAE9BC14.title: "Dust It Off"
	quest.2E7E92E3A2F2D23A.quest_desc: [
		"&eMochi&r tune a Pokémon's &eEffort Values&r: a &eHearty Grains&r, a &eHoney Bottle&r and one EV Berry cook into 3."
		""
		"Each EV Mochi adds 4 EVs to one stat; Fresh-Start Mochi wipes all EVs back to 0."
		""
		"&aEV Berries come from Berry mutations (Berries and Apricorns chapter).&r"
	]
	quest.2E7E92E3A2F2D23A.title: "Mochi Theory"
	quest.2E88B96D7E2A2D46.quest_desc: [
		"Craft a &eSaw&r from a Carpenter's Table and an Iron Ingot."
		""
		"Use it to open the Carpenter's Table menu wherever you are."
	]
	quest.2E88B96D7E2A2D46.title: "Saw"
	quest.2EA3F979A0223C82.quest_desc: [
		"Fill your party with six Pokémon."
		""
		"Once the party is full, new catches go straight to your &ePC&r."
	]
	quest.2EA3F979A0223C82.title: "Full House"
	quest.2EAB9549EEE2B69E.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e750 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"1.5× catch rate"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.2EAB9549EEE2B69E.quest_subtitle: "750 CD"
	quest.2EAB9549EEE2B69E.title: "Ancient Great Ball"
	quest.2EB22355715ACE5A.quest_desc: [
		"Find a &eShiny Stone Ore&r: it generates under floral, magical and sky-high biomes, more rarely under islands and peaks."
		"Look at the regular stone variant, found above the deepslate layer."
		""
		"&aPokémon tip:&r this stone evolves Pokémon such as Togetic, Roselia and Minccino."
	]
	quest.2EB22355715ACE5A.title: "Shiny Stone Ore"
	quest.2EB76F525C1664D4.quest_desc: ["Craft an &eAttack Silver Cap&r: four Iron Ingots, two Diamonds and three &eRed Mint Leaves&r. It Hyper Trains the Attack IV to 31."]
	quest.2EB76F525C1664D4.title: "Attack Silver Cap"
	quest.2EBAD9C6C5EE7E09.quest_desc: [
		"Plenty of Pokémon evolve at a set level, but some also care about the time of day, the moves they know, who else is in your party, the weather or how far they have walked."
		""
		"The quests next to this one show one example of each."
	]
	quest.2EBAD9C6C5EE7E09.title: "Beyond Level Ups"
	quest.2EC571836A7BCC64.quest_desc: [
		"A &ePoké Rod Smithing Template&r turns a fishing rod into a Poké Rod. Treasure catches from ordinary fishing have about a 1 in 6 chance to bring one, and &eFishing Boat&r and &eShipwreck Cove&r chests hold them too."
		""
		"Copy it: the template, 7 &eGold Ingots&r and a &ePrismarine Shard&r make two."
	]
	quest.2EC571836A7BCC64.title: "Blueprint for a Rod"
	quest.2ED80D4E3CED2098.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e5,000 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"Extends the duration of Rain"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.2ED80D4E3CED2098.quest_subtitle: "5,000 CD"
	quest.2ED80D4E3CED2098.title: "Damp Rock"
	quest.2EDC6DD1DA2FA01B.quest_desc: [
		"&eNether Gold Ore&r drops 2 to 6 &eGold Nuggets&r at a time. Nine nuggets make an ingot."
		""
		"Gold is the Nether's currency: Piglins trade for it, and golden armor keeps them friendly."
	]
	quest.2EDC6DD1DA2FA01B.title: "Fool's Gold? Real Gold"
	quest.2EDF5050B1BFAB53.quest_desc: [
		"Catch a Pokémon that is both &7Steel&r and &dFairy&r."
		""
		"Immune to both Dragon and Poison, and weak only to Fire and Ground."
	]
	quest.2EDF5050B1BFAB53.title: "Pixie Plate"
	quest.2EE28F7C6815A672.quest_desc: [
		"Find a CTOV &ejungle tree village&r."
		""
		"Look in jungle biomes, where this style is built alongside the regular jungle village."
	]
	quest.2EE28F7C6815A672.title: "Life in the Canopy"
	quest.2EE357D917F41C9A.quest_desc: [
		"&e8 Copper Ingots&r around a &eSophisticated Chest&r."
		""
		"&e45 slots&r and &e1 upgrade slot&r."
	]
	quest.2EE357D917F41C9A.title: "Copper Chest"
	quest.2EF6E3B43962FAF6.quest_desc: [
		"Catch one &1Dragon&r, one &dFairy&r and one &5Poison&r Pokémon."
		""
		"Dragon moves cannot touch Fairy, Fairy is super effective against Dragon, and Poison melts Fairy."
	]
	quest.2EF6E3B43962FAF6.title: "Myths and Venom"
	quest.2F2541675F1550EF.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat 25 wild &aGrass&r-type Pokémon in battle."
		""
		"&6Weak to:&r Bug, Fire, Flying, Ice, Poison"
		"&cResists:&r Electric, Grass, Ground, Water"
	]
	quest.2F2541675F1550EF.title: "Weed Whacker"
	quest.2F3115137EB00886.quest_desc: [
		"Kill 25 &eEndermen&r."
		""
		"The higher rungs of each ladder are about stamina. A good sword, armor and a well-lit base help."
	]
	quest.2F3115137EB00886.title: "Pearl Harvest"
	quest.2F38DAD4D29D8782.quest_desc: [
		"&e2 Anvils&r, a &eDiamond&r, &eIron&r and a &eChest&r around an &eUpgrade Base&r."
		""
		"An anvil in an upgrade tab. Rename and repair wherever you stand."
	]
	quest.2F38DAD4D29D8782.title: "Anvil Upgrade"
	quest.2F3A6427C88076C6.quest_desc: [
		"Win a raid against a &eDragon-type&r boss. Most of them sit at tiers 4 and 5."
		""
		"A den's crystal colour hints at its type. Bring a strong Ice-type attacker."
	]
	quest.2F3A6427C88076C6.title: "Dragon Slayer"
	quest.2F437108D640E458.quest_desc: [
		"Use &eAuspicious Armor&r on Charcadet for Armarouge or &eMalicious Armor&r for Ceruledge."
		""
		"Auspicious Armor turns up in Bastion Remnant chests, Malicious Armor in Nether Fortress chests."
	]
	quest.2F437108D640E458.title: "Suit of Armor"
	quest.2F520CE4FA56993D.quest_desc: [
		"Win a raid against a &eSteel-type&r boss. Most of them sit at tiers 4 and 5."
		""
		"A den's crystal colour hints at its type. Bring a strong Fire-type attacker."
	]
	quest.2F520CE4FA56993D.title: "Heavy Metal"
	quest.2F67414F3355043E.quest_desc: [
		"&eGlowstone&r hangs from the Nether ceiling. Each block breaks into 2 to 4 dust, and four dust craft a block again."
		""
		"Glowstone charges Respawn Anchors, and its dust strengthens potions."
	]
	quest.2F67414F3355043E.title: "Ceiling Lights"
	quest.2F6920D9AD2D9A61.quest_desc: ["Stand on a &eTurn Table&r while it is powered and take yourself for a spin."]
	quest.2F6920D9AD2D9A61.title: "How the Turn Tables"
	quest.2F6CD0C9CBB06963.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e8,000 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.2F6CD0C9CBB06963.quest_subtitle: "8,000 CD"
	quest.2F6CD0C9CBB06963.title: "Clear Amulet"
	quest.2F74AA97352F97B1.quest_desc: [
		"Plant two different Berry trees side by side and, as they grow, one may bear a brand-new &emutated&r Berry."
		""
		"Oran next to any status Berry can give a &eLum Berry&r; Oran next to Razz, Bluk, Nanab, Wepear or Pinap can give a &eLeppa Berry&r."
	]
	quest.2F74AA97352F97B1.title: "An Unexpected Result"
	quest.2FB02A9CD84E07FF.quest_desc: [
		"&aAron&r spawn next to iron ore, in dark caves and on mountains. Alolan Geodude like iron ore too."
		""
		"Catch an Aron."
	]
	quest.2FB02A9CD84E07FF.title: "Iron Eaters"
	quest.2FCAA5799312E5E4.quest_desc: [
		"Surround a furnace with four logs to build a &eSmoker&r."
		""
		"It only cooks food, but twice as fast as a furnace: 5 seconds a piece."
	]
	quest.2FCAA5799312E5E4.title: "Smoke Signals"
	quest.303D6F458915CD03.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e6,000 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"Evolves Happiny into Chansey when held while the day"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.303D6F458915CD03.quest_subtitle: "6,000 CD"
	quest.303D6F458915CD03.title: "Oval Stone"
	quest.30505FABB37A0644.quest_desc: [
		"Brush a &eFriend Pottery Sherd&r out of Trail Ruins."
		""
		"A fitting picture for any trainer's house."
	]
	quest.30505FABB37A0644.title: "Friend Sherd"
	quest.305CD1E4F1FB2621.quest_desc: ["Sliggoo evolves into Goodra at level 50, but only while it is raining in the Overworld."]
	quest.305CD1E4F1FB2621.title: "Singing in the Rain"
	quest.30666BA190D89A1D.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e2,000 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.30666BA190D89A1D.quest_subtitle: "2,000 CD"
	quest.30666BA190D89A1D.title: "Steel Gem"
	quest.306D11CBAFDB0C81.quest_desc: [
		"&eLeader Koga&r hides in the &eFuchsia Gym&r, deep in &ejungles&r, &ebamboo jungles&r and &erainforests&r."
		""
		"Beat Trainer Brendan first. Koga's ninjas are Swellow, Accelgor, Greninja, Drapion, Dragapult and Toxtricity, and most of them strike before you do."
	]
	quest.306D11CBAFDB0C81.quest_subtitle: "Leader Koga, Fuchsia Gym"
	quest.306D11CBAFDB0C81.title: "Soul Badge"
	quest.306F878F9C9CE5BE.quest_desc: [
		"Two Iron Ingots make &eShears&r. Shear your sheep for &eWool&r; it grows back."
		""
		"&aPokémon tie-in:&r Wool goes into held items such as the &eChoice Scarf&r, &eSilk Scarf&r and &eDestiny Knot&r."
	]
	quest.306F878F9C9CE5BE.title: "Shear Delight"
	quest.307FFD470C98B66D.quest_desc: [
