		""
		"Temporarily raises the target's Sp. Def stat by one stage when used in battle"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.3B7F5D527FD63580.quest_subtitle: "1,500 CD"
	quest.3B7F5D527FD63580.title: "X Sp. Def"
	quest.3B91D0C0D6FB0A71.quest_desc: ["&eHeal Powder&r (crafted from a &eRevival Herb&r) and a &eHoney Bottle&r cook into a &eRevive&r: a fainted Pokémon gets up with half its HP."]
	quest.3B91D0C0D6FB0A71.title: "Back on Your Feet"
	quest.3BAE5EDC0A0A65BC.quest_desc: [
		"Craft all seven basic balls: 4 Apricorns of one color around a &eCopper Ingot&r."
		""
		"Red makes the Poké Ball, Yellow the Citrine, Green the Verdant, Blue the Azure, Pink the Roseate, Black the Slate and White the &ePremier Ball&r. All catch at 1x; the color is your style."
	]
	quest.3BAE5EDC0A0A65BC.title: "A Full Palette"
	quest.3BB7AA4EFA7AFF50.quest_desc: [
		"Catch 10 &5Poison&r-type Pokémon. Dual-type Pokémon count for both of their types."
		""
		"&6Strong against:&r Grass, Fairy"
	]
	quest.3BB7AA4EFA7AFF50.title: "Toxic Friends"
	quest.3BBCD5A64716B065.quest_desc: ["&bGiratina Island&r floats in the Distortion World. Offer a &eGriseous Orb&r (Turnback Cave vaults, or craft one) at its pedestal to summon &dGiratina&r and receive an &eAntimatter Globe&r."]
	quest.3BBCD5A64716B065.title: "The Renegade"
	quest.3BC2EF4B1F48BC40.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e600 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"Raises the Pokémon's Sp. Atk EVs by 1"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.3BC2EF4B1F48BC40.quest_subtitle: "600 CD"
	quest.3BC2EF4B1F48BC40.title: "Genius Feather"
	quest.3BC54174C2A46D44.quest_desc: [
		"Apricorn trees grow in forests, jungles, taigas, deserts and more, in all seven colors at random."
		""
		"Collect one of each: &eRed&r, &eYellow&r, &eGreen&r, &eBlue&r, &ePink&r, &eBlack&r and &eWhite&r. Each color crafts different Poké Balls."
	]
	quest.3BC54174C2A46D44.title: "Seven Shades of Apricorn"
	quest.3BDE8FEFBEDFD7F0.quest_desc: ["Evolve 10 Pokémon of any kind. Every method in this chapter counts."]
	quest.3BDE8FEFBEDFD7F0.title: "Growing Pains"
	quest.3BE3EDA47458F2CD.quest_desc: [
		"Open an &eOminous Vault&r with an Ominous Trial Key."
		""
		"Ominous Vaults are the only place to find the &eHeavy Core&r and the &eFlow&r trim."
	]
	quest.3BE3EDA47458F2CD.title: "Ominous Spoils"
	quest.3BEE5C7D2E32571D.quest_desc: [
		"Get some &eLeftovers&r: the holder slowly restores HP during battle."
		""
		"They cannot be crafted. &eSnorlax&r, &eMunchlax&r, &eTrubbish&r and &eGarbodor&r may drop them, and eating an Apple has a small (2.5%) chance to leave some behind."
	]
	quest.3BEE5C7D2E32571D.title: "Waste Not"
	quest.3BEEC322F3FBFE0B.quest_desc: [
		"Snowfields, glaciers and frozen coasts: home turf for &eIce&r-types."
		""
		"&aTip:&r some cold-climate spawns, like a lone Cubchoo or Cetoddle, only happen while it is snowing."
		"A snowstorm is the best time to explore."
	]
	quest.3BEEC322F3FBFE0B.title: "The Frozen North"
	quest.3C01A321F153C074.quest_desc: [
		"Caves, ores and the strange biomes beneath the surface."
		""
		"Learn where every ore hides, track down Cobblemon's &eevolution stone ores&r, crack open geodes and descend into the &5Deep Dark&r."
		""
		"&aPack torches, food and a bucket of water.&r"
	]
	quest.3C01A321F153C074.quest_subtitle: "Bring torches. Lots of torches."
	quest.3C01A321F153C074.title: "&lInto the Depths&r"
	quest.3C044286531C6C76.quest_desc: ["Find the &eCelestica Flute&r in a Turnback Cave vault, or buy it from a Master Entrepreneur."]
