		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.5195327D336D9E44.quest_subtitle: "2,000 CD"
	quest.5195327D336D9E44.title: "Dragon Gem"
	quest.51AFE76526DAB814.quest_desc: ["Find the &bHeatran Cave&r in the Nether (carry the Magma Stone and the Arc Phone tracks it) and set the stone on its pedestal to summon &dHeatran&r."]
	quest.51AFE76526DAB814.title: "Lava Lurker"
	quest.51EB369583C940F3.quest_desc: [
		"Six &eWhite Wool&r and a stick make a &eFlag&r (dyed wool makes colored ones)."
		""
		"Place sticks to build a pole and attach the flag; right-click or left-click the pole to lower or raise it."
	]
	quest.51EB369583C940F3.title: "Plant Your Flag"
	quest.51F0F67792F3E445.quest_desc: [
		"Catch a Pokémon with a &eNet Ball&r."
		""
		"&aTry it on Water- and Bug-type Pokémon.&r"
	]
	quest.51F0F67792F3E445.title: "Nothing but Net"
	quest.51F4B1D44D5BAD33.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e8,000 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"Increases a Pokémon's experience by 30000 Exp. Points"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.51F4B1D44D5BAD33.quest_subtitle: "8,000 CD"
	quest.51F4B1D44D5BAD33.title: "Exp. Candy XL"
	quest.520A9BF9E2B90860.quest_desc: [
		"Taking fire damage grants 30 seconds of Fire Resistance (once a minute)."
		""
		"&6Where to look:&r mineshaft chests, Ruined Portals, shipwreck treasure; rarely worn by piglins."
	]
	quest.520A9BF9E2B90860.title: "Obsidian Skull"
	quest.520C670A824FDBC4.quest_desc: ["Find a &eLight Stone Shard&r or &eDark Stone Shard&r. They turn up in monument chests (Bell Tower, Lugia Temple, Liberty Island, Crown Shrine, Thalic Pyramid), drop from the &cWarden&r and the &cWither&r, and Expert Entrepreneurs sell them."]
	quest.520C670A824FDBC4.title: "Shards of Truth and Ideals"
	quest.5228B3EAC3723CD8.quest_desc: [
		"Brew a &7Potion of Invisibility&r: add a &eFermented Spider Eye&r to a Potion of Night Vision."
		""
		"&cArmor and held items still show.&r"
	]
	quest.5228B3EAC3723CD8.title: "Now You See Me"
	quest.526D78C90C2F6FCF.quest_desc: [
		"An easy first dish: an &eApple&r, &eSugar&r and a &eStick&r make a &eCandied Apple&r."
		""
		"Swap the apple for 3 Berries and you get &eCandied Berries&r instead."
	]
	quest.526D78C90C2F6FCF.title: "Fair Food"
	quest.5273D545770EF90E.quest_desc: [
		"&eWither Skeletons&r patrol fortresses and only drop their skull when a player kills them: a 2.5% chance, 3.5% with Looting I and one more percent per extra Looting level."
		""
		"Three skulls and four Soul Sand summon &cthe Wither&r. That fight lives in the &eMonster Hunter&r chapter."
	]
	quest.5273D545770EF90E.title: "Skull Collector"
	quest.5287C0C6B3B196BE.quest_desc: [
		"From copper veins to the Deep Dark, you have mapped the world below."
		""
		"Obsidian opens the way to &cThe Nether&r and to &dEnchanting and Brewing&r."
	]
	quest.5287C0C6B3B196BE.title: "Master of the Underground"
	quest.52890FE1ABEE9855.quest_desc: [
		"A wooden &eSword&r, &ePickaxe&r, &eAxe&r and &eShovel&r with &eIron&r and &eRedstone&r around an &eUpgrade Base&r."
		""
		"When you left-click a block or mob, it swaps the right tool from the backpack into your hand."
	]
	quest.52890FE1ABEE9855.title: "Tool Swapper Upgrade"
	quest.529EE04446CB0275.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e2,500 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"Raises a random stat by 2 when at 1/4 max HP or less"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
