		"Place the Rainbow Feather on the &dHo-Oh&r pedestal in the Pagoda's &bBell Tower&r."
		""
		"Keep Ho-Oh in your party: Pokémon you defeat leave &eSacred Ash&r, which restores your whole party's HP and PP outside battle."
