		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.58051C1C442669E4.quest_subtitle: "30,000 CD"
	quest.58051C1C442669E4.title: "Revive x10"
	quest.5814BAD61B8B944D.quest_desc: [
		"Catch &dArticuno&r, &dZapdos&r and &dMoltres&r. A charged urn summons each one and leaves its stone behind: Arctic, Zap and Molten."
		""
		"&aWild ones are ultra-rare: Articuno on frozen oceans and glaciers, Zapdos on plains and savannas, Moltres in badlands.&r"
	]
	quest.5814BAD61B8B944D.title: "Birds of a Feather"
	quest.5828A783B823BC27.quest_desc: [
		"&2Lush Caves&r are full of moss, azalea and glowing &eCave Vines&r. Pick their berries."
		""
		"&aPokémon tip:&r Wooper and Shuckle spawn here, and Cobblemon's Revival Herb grows in lush caves. Glow berries, moss and a bowl make &eLuminous Moss&r."
	]
	quest.5828A783B823BC27.title: "Lush Life"
	quest.582F7B0EA1B960C0.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e2,000 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"Allows a Pokémon to evolve that would require trading"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.582F7B0EA1B960C0.quest_subtitle: "2,000 CD"
	quest.582F7B0EA1B960C0.title: "Link Cable"
	quest.5837191B2FCA276B.quest_desc: [
		"Wild Pokémon depend on where you stand: every biome has its own spawn list."
		""
		"Craft a &eNature's Compass&r (a &eCompass&r ringed by four Logs and four Saplings), pick a biome and it points the way, coordinates included."
		"&aSearching is free and the compass never breaks.&r"
		""
		"Each climate below lists Pokémon you can meet there."
	]
	quest.5837191B2FCA276B.title: "Nature's Compass"
	quest.58499CEF335E75F6.quest_desc: [
		"Scan &e10&r Pokémon with your Pokédex."
		""
		"The scanner reaches Pokémon up to &e10&r blocks away and registers species you have not met yet."
	]
	quest.58499CEF335E75F6.title: "Point and Scan"
	quest.58687B00301BEFB7.quest_desc: ["Mega Evolve a &eGarchomp&r holding its Garchompite."]
	quest.58687B00301BEFB7.title: "Land Shark Deluxe"
	quest.586C52E3B0EA2ACA.quest_desc: [
		"Surround the previous Heal Upgrade with &e4 Blocks of Diamond&r."
		""
		"Cuts the recharge time by &e60%&r: about &e60 seconds&r between heals."
	]
	quest.586C52E3B0EA2ACA.title: "Heal Upgrade Tier 3"
	quest.5884D0E5321ED962.quest_desc: [
		"A &eHoney Bottle&r, any &eMushroom&r and &eWheat&r cook into 4 &ePoké Bait&r."
		""
		"Seasoned bait carries the effects of its Berries onto your Poké Rod. The &aFishing&r chapter shows how to use it."
	]
	quest.5884D0E5321ED962.title: "Something Smells Fishy"
	quest.58A7F1D53C3EA032.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e2,000 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"Fully restores all PP to one of a Pokémon's selected moves"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.58A7F1D53C3EA032.quest_subtitle: "2,000 CD"
	quest.58A7F1D53C3EA032.title: "Max Ether"
	quest.58B372E75634074E.quest_desc: [
		"Upgrade the &eWireless Terminal&r at a &eSmithing Table&r with a &eNetherite Upgrade Smithing Template&r and a &eNetherite Ingot&r."
		""
		"Sneak and right-click a terminal to bind it, then open it from &e64 blocks&r away with a keybind. A &eBeacon&r within 8 blocks of the terminal extends that: any level for the whole dimension, level 4 for anywhere."
	]
	quest.58B372E75634074E.title: "Advanced Wireless Terminal"
	quest.58EAC0CB3620AC8A.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e5,000 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"Boosts the power of the holder's Flying-type moves"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.58EAC0CB3620AC8A.quest_subtitle: "5,000 CD"
	quest.58EAC0CB3620AC8A.title: "Sharp Beak"
	quest.5913975AD290083D.quest_desc: [
		"Adds a level of Looting to everything you kill."
		""
		"&6Where to look:&r mineshaft chests, Pillager Outposts, big Ocean Ruins, village armorers, brushing Desert Wells."
	]
	quest.5913975AD290083D.title: "Superstitious Hat"
	quest.592AE51436AD3B8E.quest_desc: [
		"Walk on Powder Snow and move faster on snow."
		""
		"&6Where to look:&r igloo basements, Ancient City ice boxes, snowy and taiga village houses; rarely worn by strays."
	]
	quest.592AE51436AD3B8E.title: "Snowshoes"
	quest.593A06DC2AF2C8B2.quest_desc: [
		"Apply all eight rare templates at least once: Spire, Snout, Rib, Ward, Silence, Vex, Tide and Wayfinder."
		""
		"Snout hides in Bastion Remnants, Silence in Ancient Cities and Vex in Woodland Mansions."
	]
	quest.593A06DC2AF2C8B2.title: "Runway Ready"
	quest.593B9492B7DE4EA6.quest_desc: [
		"Two &eRevives&r and a &eVivichoke&r cook into a &eMax Revive&r: full HP on revival."
		""
		"A Max Revive is also the heart of a home &eHealing Machine&r."
	]
	quest.593B9492B7DE4EA6.title: "Second Wind"
	quest.594546406197B8E6.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat 25 wild &7Steel&r-type Pokémon in battle."
		""
		"&6Weak to:&r Fighting, Fire, Ground"
		"&cResists:&r Bug, Dragon, Fairy, Flying, Grass, Ice, Normal, Psychic, Rock, Steel"
		"&cImmune to:&r Poison"
	]
	quest.594546406197B8E6.title: "Metal Fatigue"
	quest.59487CCFDDAEC660.quest_desc: [
		"Fields, herds, hives, fish and seasons: your homestead runs like clockwork."
		""
		"Claim this once the Cake, Pie, Golden Carrot, Beehive, Catch of the Day and Calendar quests are done."
	]
	quest.59487CCFDDAEC660.title: "Harvest Festival"
	quest.59753C6637554764.quest_desc: [
		"Your melee hits have a 30% chance to inflict Wither."
		""
		"&6Where to look:&r Bastion hoglin stables, brushing cold Ocean Ruins."
	]
	quest.59753C6637554764.title: "Withered Bracelet"
	quest.598ADA2032E94047.quest_desc: [
		"Craft a &eBlue Orb&r from two Prismarine, an Ice Gem, five Prismarine Crystals and a Water Stone, or find one in a Legendary Monuments shrine."
		""
		"Held by Kyogre, it triggers Primal Reversion. Kyogre itself is in the Legends and Myths chapter."
	]
	quest.598ADA2032E94047.title: "Primal Tide"
	quest.59BB100EBFA73059.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e1,500 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"Halves damage taken from a Normal-type attack"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.59BB100EBFA73059.quest_subtitle: "1,500 CD"
	quest.59BB100EBFA73059.title: "Chilan Berry"
	quest.5A0F33FB0683E6F1.quest_desc: [
		"Plant a Berry on &eFarmland&r (a Supplementaries &ePlanter&r works too) and it grows into a tree."
		""
		"Right-click a ripe tree with an empty hand to harvest it; Bone Meal speeds it along. Grow &e16 Oran Berries&r."
		""
		"&aTip:&r a Berry grown in its preferred biome gives a bigger harvest."
	]
	quest.5A0F33FB0683E6F1.title: "Berry Farmer"
	quest.5A146CB8B477C125.quest_desc: [
		"Find a Terralith &emage tower&r."
		""
		"Look in magical biomes such as Moonlight Valley, Lavender Valley, Amethyst Canyon and the Mirage Isles; the floating Skylands have seasonal versions."
	]
	quest.5A146CB8B477C125.title: "Ivory Tower"
	quest.5A1F9D9CA86A24F0.quest_desc: [
		"Charizard's first Mega Stone, for Mega Charizard X."
		""
		"Recipe: raw Mega Stone, two Iron Ingots, a Diamond and a &eDragon Fang&r."
	]
	quest.5A1F9D9CA86A24F0.title: "Charizardite X"
	quest.5A20248016B49B66.quest_desc: [
		"Craft a &eConduit&r: a Heart of the Sea surrounded by 8 Nautilus Shells."
		""
		"Place it in water inside a frame of Prismarine, Prismarine Bricks, Dark Prismarine or Sea Lanterns. With 16 frame blocks it grants &bConduit Power&r to players in the water nearby."
		"&aA full 42-block frame also attacks hostile mobs close by.&r"
	]
	quest.5A20248016B49B66.title: "Ocean's Gift"
	quest.5A3848693F9F239C.quest_desc: [
		"Craft a &ePower Bracer&r: two Red Mint Leaves, four Concrete and two Diamonds. Its holder gains 8 Attack EVs every time it earns experience in battle."
		""
		"Same frame, other leaves: White = Power Weight (HP), Blue = Belt (Def), Cyan = Lens (Sp. Atk), Pink = Band (Sp. Def), Green = Anklet (Speed)."
	]
	quest.5A3848693F9F239C.title: "Power Bracer"
	quest.5A46CBB37C3AF548.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e5,000 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"Changes a Pokémon's stats to be that of a Naughty nature"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.5A46CBB37C3AF548.quest_subtitle: "5,000 CD"
	quest.5A46CBB37C3AF548.title: "Naughty Mint"
	quest.5A54BCC4E4294703.quest_desc: [
		"&eHoglins&r roam Crimson Forests and charge anything that moves. They avoid &eWarped Fungus&r."
		""
		"Kill 5. They drop raw Porkchops and Leather, the best food source in the Nether."
	]
	quest.5A54BCC4E4294703.title: "Boar Hunt"
	quest.5A61163356CEE164.quest_desc: [
		"Mine some stone with your pickaxe."
		""
		"&eCobblestone&r, &eBlackstone&r and &eCobbled Deepslate&r all count as stone for furnaces and tools."
	]
	quest.5A61163356CEE164.title: "Stone Age"
	quest.5A629073DEFA8779.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e1,500 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"Halves damage taken from a supereffective Ground-type attack"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.5A629073DEFA8779.quest_subtitle: "1,500 CD"
	quest.5A629073DEFA8779.title: "Shuca Berry"
	quest.5A6631501F987334.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e8,000 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"Boosts the power of the holder's Physical moves"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.5A6631501F987334.quest_subtitle: "8,000 CD"
	quest.5A6631501F987334.title: "Muscle Band"
	quest.5AA8ABCBCA431195.quest_desc: [
		"Craft a &eTera Orb&r: four Amethyst Shards, an Ender Pearl, two Glowstone Dust, a Diamond and Blaze Powder."
		""
		"Wear it in the &eTera Wear&r slot. Every Pokémon has a Tera Type of its own."
	]
	quest.5AA8ABCBCA431195.title: "Crystal Ball"
	quest.5AAC2434DF3444BE.quest_desc: [
		"Complete a trade with any villager."
		""
		"Right-click a villager with a job to see its offers. Trading levels it up and unlocks better deals."
		"&aEmeralds are the currency, and many villagers pay Emeralds for common goods like crops, paper or coal.&r"
	]
	quest.5AAC2434DF3444BE.title: "Open for Business"
	quest.5AB6A448F26216C7.quest_desc: [
		"Five &eIron Nuggets&r and an &eIron Ingot&r make a &eGoblet&r."
		""
		"Place it and pour a drink in. Fancy tableware for your dining hall."
	]
	quest.5AB6A448F26216C7.title: "Fit for a King"
	quest.5AB7A4107D125843.quest_desc: ["Use an &eIce Stone&r on Eevee."]
	quest.5AB7A4107D125843.title: "Glaceon"
	quest.5AB8CA50DE19FBA5.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e150 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.5AB8CA50DE19FBA5.quest_subtitle: "150 CD"
	quest.5AB8CA50DE19FBA5.title: "Blue Apricorn"
	quest.5AC5828F0115B86F.quest_desc: [
		"From Kanto to Paldea, your notes cover every region."
		""
		"This unlocks once all nine region quests are done."
	]
	quest.5AC5828F0115B86F.title: "World Researcher"
	quest.5ACB87E5D1D4C237.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e400 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"1× catch rate"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.5ACB87E5D1D4C237.quest_subtitle: "400 CD"
	quest.5ACB87E5D1D4C237.title: "Roseate Ball"
	quest.5AD271E3DBED1AE0.quest_desc: [
		"&eGold Nuggets&r, an &eInk Sac&r and &ePaper&r make 3 &eReturn Scrolls&r."
		""
		"Hold use to read one and you warp to your &enearest&r activated waystone."
	]
	quest.5AD271E3DBED1AE0.title: "Take Me Back"
	quest.5AD52DB17D912CAA.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e300 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"Holder wakes up if it is asleep"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.5AD52DB17D912CAA.quest_subtitle: "300 CD"
	quest.5AD52DB17D912CAA.title: "Chesto Berry"
	quest.5AF299425C006177.quest_desc: [
		"Use a tool on a Pokémon to collect a product. A few examples:"
		"a Bucket on &eMiltank&r for milk, a Glass Bottle on &eVespiquen&r for honey, a Brush on bird Pokémon for Feathers, a Bucket on &eNumel&r or &eSlugma&r for lava."
	]
	quest.5AF299425C006177.title: "Home on the Range"
	quest.5AFC3CA6E00A3CD5.quest_desc: [
		"&e2 Iron Ingots&r, &e2 Pistons&r and &e2 Redstone&r around a &eStorage Upgrade Base&r."
		""
		"Storage-only: it automatically compresses and decompresses items as they move in and out."
	]
	quest.5AFC3CA6E00A3CD5.title: "Compression Upgrade"
	quest.5B169F2185E4867E.quest_desc: [
		"Find the Explorify &eruins&r in the jungle."
		""
		"Ruined houses around a monument, with treasure and a spawner to deal with."
	]
	quest.5B169F2185E4867E.title: "Lost City"
	quest.5B2C056E4F7528B3.quest_desc: [
		"Brew a &cPotion of Healing&r: Awkward Potion + &eGlistering Melon Slice&r."
		""
		"It heals instantly. Glowstone turns it into Healing II."
	]
	quest.5B2C056E4F7528B3.title: "Healing Touch"
	quest.5B2F895D74E59325.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e2,000 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.5B2F895D74E59325.quest_subtitle: "2,000 CD"
	quest.5B2F895D74E59325.title: "Dark Gem"
	quest.5BC40602930DD665.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e2,000 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.5BC40602930DD665.quest_subtitle: "2,000 CD"
	quest.5BC40602930DD665.title: "Bug Gem"
	quest.5BF603C94D0B8232.quest_desc: [
		"&eEnder Pearl&r, &eIron&r, &eRedstone&r and a &eChest&r around an &eUpgrade Base&r."
		""
		"Keeps chosen stacks in your inventory topped up from the backpack: torches, food, Poké Balls."
	]
	quest.5BF603C94D0B8232.title: "Refill Upgrade"
	quest.5C1876465104EA01.quest_desc: [
		"&eSculk Sensors&r in the Deep Dark hear every step, and Sculk Shriekers summon the Warden after a few warnings."
		""
		"Sneak past a Sculk Sensor or a Warden without being heard. Sneaking is the key to surviving Ancient Cities."
	]
	quest.5C1876465104EA01.title: "Quiet as a Mouse"
	quest.5C27BC61215FA1FB.quest_desc: [
		"The Red Chain wears down each time you use it and finally snaps into a &eFragmented Red Chain&r."
		""
		"&aCombine it with &eOrigin Ingots&a in an Anvil to restore it.&r"
	]
	quest.5C27BC61215FA1FB.title: "Snapped!"
	quest.5C4F763B8252DE03.quest_desc: [
		"Have every potion effect on you at the same time: Speed, Slowness, Strength, Jump Boost, Regeneration, Fire Resistance, Water Breathing, Invisibility, Night Vision, Weakness, Poison, Slow Falling, Resistance and the four trial-era effects."
		""
		"&aBrew extended versions with Redstone and drink the short ones last.&r"
	]
	quest.5C4F763B8252DE03.title: "A Furious Cocktail"
	quest.5C633B9FD67AE82B.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e6,000 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.5C633B9FD67AE82B.quest_subtitle: "6,000 CD"
	quest.5C633B9FD67AE82B.title: "Mirror Herb"
	quest.5C67E6771EEFA1E3.quest_desc: [
		"&e8 Copper Ingots&r around a &eFurnace&r."
		""
		"At &e180 ticks&r per item it is only a small step up from vanilla, but it is cheap, and the Rainbow Plating recipe needs one. A Copper Furnace can also go straight into an Iron Furnace recipe with &e6 Iron Ingots&r and &e2 Glass&r."
	]
	quest.5C67E6771EEFA1E3.title: "Copper Furnace"
	quest.5C6BC1C00A854167.quest_desc: [
		"Win &e100&r battles against trainers of any kind."
		""
		"Story trainers count, and so does every youngster, hiker and grunt you meet on the way."
	]
	quest.5C6BC1C00A854167.quest_subtitle: "100 trainer wins"
	quest.5C6BC1C00A854167.title: "Hundred-Battle Veteran"
	quest.5C78AECE99506753.quest_desc: ["Make an &eAbility Capsule&r: brew Medicinal Brew with Dragon's Breath, or craft Glow Ink Sac, an Amethyst Shard, a Bottle o' Enchanting and Blaze Powder. It switches a Pokémon to its other standard ability."]
	quest.5C78AECE99506753.title: "New Talent"
	quest.5C7E6C3425E44EAA.quest_desc: [
		"Two more boxes, two more recipes. Both take Payapa, Haban and Wepear Berries;"
		"the &eLatias Treat&r adds Apicot Berries, the &eLatios Treat&r adds Petaya Berries."
		"&aApicot and Petaya only come from berry mutation (see the Berries chapter).&r"
	]
	quest.5C7E6C3425E44EAA.title: "Dessert for Two"
	quest.5C86241CAB7F1DFD.quest_desc: [
		"&6Brewing 101&r"
		"Bottles go in the 3 bottom slots, one ingredient on top, &eBlaze Powder&r fuel on the left."
		"Water Bottle + &eNether Wart&r = &eAwkward Potion&r, the base of almost every potion."
		""
		"&6Modifiers&r"
		"&eRedstone&r: lasts longer. &eGlowstone Dust&r: stronger. &eFermented Spider Eye&r: corrupts the effect."
		"&eGunpowder&r: splash. &eDragon's Breath&r: lingering."
	]
	quest.5C86241CAB7F1DFD.title: "How Brewing Works"
	quest.5C8B9DDD1992B276.quest_desc: [
		"Two kinds of adventure live here."
		""
		"&6Archaeology&r: brush suspicious sand and gravel for pottery sherds, Sniffer eggs and armor trim templates."
		"&6Trial Chambers&r: copper vaults under the ground, full of trial spawners, Breezes and the parts for the &eMace&r."
		"&aPokémon tip:&r Cobblemon's fossil dig sites hide fossils in suspicious gravel. See &eFossils and Geology&r."
	]
	quest.5C8B9DDD1992B276.quest_subtitle: "History, trims and a very heavy hammer"
	quest.5C8B9DDD1992B276.title: "&lTrials and Archaeology&r"
	quest.5C992FC16EE9C384.quest_desc: [
		"An &eInventory Trim&r on a &eStick&r."
		""
		"Configures how each inventory talks to the connector: include or skip blocks, set filters and priorities. Item, Tag and Polymorphic Item Filters give even finer control."
	]
	quest.5C992FC16EE9C384.title: "Inventory Configurator"
	quest.5C9F033BC95863C6.quest_desc: [
		"Fuse Necrozma with Solgaleo or Lunala, give it Ultranecrozium-Z and &eUltra Burst&r in battle into Ultra Necrozma."
		""
		"&aCatching these legends is covered in the Legends and Myths chapter.&r"
	]
	quest.5C9F033BC95863C6.title: "Blinding Light"
	quest.5CA1012B9F12DB49.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e1,500 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"Halves damage taken from a supereffective Poison-type attack"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.5CA1012B9F12DB49.quest_subtitle: "1,500 CD"
	quest.5CA1012B9F12DB49.title: "Kebia Berry"
	quest.5CA2938988D2B9FF.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e1,500 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"Halves damage taken from a supereffective Fighting-type attack"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.5CA2938988D2B9FF.quest_subtitle: "1,500 CD"
	quest.5CA2938988D2B9FF.title: "Chople Berry"
	quest.5CAC08A6DD925957.quest_desc: [
		"&eGold Nuggets&r, a &eFeather&r and &ePaper&r make 3 &eBlank Scrolls&r."
		""
		"Use one on a waystone to bind it: the &eBound Scroll&r always takes you to that exact waystone. Great for gifting a friend the way to your base."
	]
	quest.5CAC08A6DD925957.title: "Signed and Sealed"
	quest.5CD2BB61A4ECE7A0.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e500 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"Restores 1/3 max HP at 1/4 max HP or less; confuses if -Spe Nature"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.5CD2BB61A4ECE7A0.quest_subtitle: "500 CD"
	quest.5CD2BB61A4ECE7A0.title: "Mago Berry"
	quest.5CF6937DEE8E517A.quest_desc: [
		"A Blaze Rod on top of Popped Chorus Fruit crafts four &eEnd Rods&r."
		""
		"They are bright, thin light sources that point in any direction."
	]
	quest.5CF6937DEE8E517A.title: "Rod of Light"
	quest.5CFFF2869978803B.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat a &eBreeze&r for a &eBreeze Rod&r. Breezes only come from Trial Spawners."
		""
		"Rods make Wind Charges, repair the Mace and brew the Wind Charged potion."
	]
	quest.5CFFF2869978803B.title: "Rod of the Wind"
	quest.5D0AF547A7CE8CD9.quest_desc: [
		"Craft a &eFermented Spider Eye&r: a Spider Eye, a Brown Mushroom and Sugar."
		""
		"It corrupts potions: Night Vision into Invisibility, Healing and Poison into Harming, Swiftness and Leaping into Slowness."
	]
	quest.5D0AF547A7CE8CD9.title: "Spoiled Rotten"
	quest.5D203857EAFB862E.quest_desc: [
		"Catch any Galar starter."
		""
		"&bGrookey&r in jungles, &bScorbunny&r on grasslands, &bSobble&r in forests and swamps."
	]
	quest.5D203857EAFB862E.title: "Postwick Partners"
	quest.5D225317E263461B.quest_desc: [
		"Take part in &e10&r raids, as host or guest."
		""
		"Each den can be cleared &e3 times&r before it goes dark. After about two hours of play it resets with a new boss and tier. Failed raids can be retried."
	]
	quest.5D225317E263461B.title: "Raid Regular"
	quest.5D4461103D090E80.quest_desc: [
		"A &eShulker&r bullet makes you float. Get lifted 50 blocks by it."
		""
		"&cWarning:&r the trip down is the dangerous part. Drink milk or carry a Water Bucket or Slow Falling."
	]
	quest.5D4461103D090E80.title: "Up, Up and Away"
	quest.5D4E60E1ABCC10B1.quest_desc: [
		"Kill 10 &eCreepers&r."
		""
		"Creepers hiss before they explode. Hit them and step back. They drop &eGunpowder&r for TNT and Firework Rockets."
	]
	quest.5D4E60E1ABCC10B1.title: "That's a Nice House"
	quest.5D55980CF9560A04.quest_desc: [
		"Use a Revive, a Max Revive or a raw &eRevival Herb&r on a fainted Pokémon."
		""
		"The raw herb only restores a quarter of its HP and lowers friendship: cook it when you can."
	]
	quest.5D55980CF9560A04.title: "Live to Fight Another Day"
	quest.5D79CDAB13621526.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e6,000 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"Boosts the holder's Accuracy"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.5D79CDAB13621526.quest_subtitle: "6,000 CD"
	quest.5D79CDAB13621526.title: "Zoom Lens"
	quest.5DB1B2BD248A6B4D.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e500 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"Restores 1/3 max HP at 1/4 max HP or less; confuses if -SpA Nature"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.5DB1B2BD248A6B4D.quest_subtitle: "500 CD"
	quest.5DB1B2BD248A6B4D.title: "Wiki Berry"
	quest.5DB4490CFA591C64.quest_desc: [
		"Berries are more than a snack. A &eCampfire Pot&r turns them into food, bait and treats, and the &eBrewing Stand&r turns them into medicine."
		""
		"Above the line: &6food&r, desserts, Mochi, regional dishes and Aprijuice. Below it: &6medicine&r, from Potions to Full Restores."
		""
		"&aIngredients grow in the Berries and Apricorns chapter. Click the checkmark to begin.&r"
	]
	quest.5DB4490CFA591C64.quest_subtitle: "Something smells good"
	quest.5DB4490CFA591C64.title: "&lThe Trainer's Kitchen"
	quest.5DB7EAB460BFCC95.quest_desc: [
		"Cook all seven &eSweets&r: one &eDye&r, a &eHoney Bottle&r and &eSugar&r each."
		"Red: Strawberry. Pink: Love. Blue: Berry. Green: Clover."
		"Orange: Flower. Yellow: Star. Purple: Ribbon."
		"Each one evolves &eMilcery&r into a different Alcremie."
	]
	quest.5DB7EAB460BFCC95.title: "Sweet Shop"
	quest.5DE3D624ADFB6A7C.quest_desc: [
		"The Rainbow Badge draws out the head of Team Rocket. &eBoss Giovanni&r walks the &ebadlands&r and &esavannas&r."
		""
		"Nidoking, Honchkrow, Infernape, Kangaskhan and a Frost Rotom stand between you and the next gym."
	]
	quest.5DE3D624ADFB6A7C.quest_subtitle: "Boss Giovanni"
	quest.5DE3D624ADFB6A7C.title: "Behind the Scenes"
	quest.5DF49EA1BA0AF853.quest_desc: [
		"Use a &eTart Apple&r (Flapple), &eSweet Apple&r (Appletun) or &eSyrupy Apple&r (Dipplin) on Applin. All three drop from Saccharine Leaves."
		""
		"&aTip:&r Dipplin that knows Dragon Cheer evolves again into Hydrapple when it levels up."
	]
	quest.5DF49EA1BA0AF853.title: "Apple of My Eye"
	quest.5E01173F271FBA1D.quest_desc: [
		"Craft a set of &eNeedles&r from a Loom Table and a Stick."
		""
		"Use it to open the Loom Table menu wherever you are."
	]
	quest.5E01173F271FBA1D.title: "Needles"
	quest.5E2C57C4AF22CBB7.quest_desc: [
		"Catch a Pokémon with a &eLove Ball&r."
		""
		"&aBattle with a Pokémon of the same species and opposite gender for the 8x bonus.&r"
	]
	quest.5E2C57C4AF22CBB7.title: "Love at First Throw"
	quest.5E36194256C8E2CC.quest_desc: [
		"Craft a &eChiseled Bookshelf&r (6 Planks and 3 Wooden Slabs), slot a book into it and read it with a &eRedstone Comparator&r."
		""
		"The comparator signal changes with the slot you touched, which makes it a neat trigger for secret doors."
	]
	quest.5E36194256C8E2CC.title: "Hidden Signal"
	quest.5E3B2A3DB2884FDE.quest_desc: [
		"Jagged basalt and blackstone full of &eMagma Cubes&r. Watch your step around the lava pools."
		""
		"&6Pokémon:&r Magby, Magmar, Slugma, Torkoal, Salandit, Sizzlipede and Heatmor."
		"Ace Trainers and Battle Girls battle on the deltas, as they do all over the Nether."
	]
	quest.5E3B2A3DB2884FDE.title: "Basalt Deltas"
	quest.5E53269FB90BF646.quest_desc: [
		"Furnaces from this mod accept &eAugments&r: hold one and right-click to insert it."
		""
		"All six augments share one recipe shape: &eStone&r in the corners, &eRedstone&r top and bottom, &ePaper&r on the sides and a key item in the middle. Most trade one stat for another, so pick the one that fits the job."
	]
	quest.5E53269FB90BF646.title: "Augment Slots"
	quest.5E7540FEDED035EC.quest_desc: [
		"Win &e15&r raids of any tier."
		""
		"Only wins where you dealt enough damage to earn rewards count."
	]
	quest.5E7540FEDED035EC.quest_subtitle: "15 raid wins"
	quest.5E7540FEDED035EC.title: "Raid Squad"
	quest.5E7A67CD74C94031.quest_desc: [
		"Craft a batch of &eBeast Balls&r: a &eDiamond&r core ringed by 4 &eEcho Shards&r and 4 &eGold Ingots&r makes 8. Have all 8."
		""
		"&cOnly for Ultra Beasts:&r 5x on them, 0.1x on anything else. Echo Shards come from Ancient City chests."
	]
	quest.5E7A67CD74C94031.title: "Beyond the Wormhole"
	quest.5E968A2A70FEB0E3.quest_desc: [
		"Scan &e100&r Pokémon with your Pokédex."
		""
		"The scanner reaches Pokémon up to &e10&r blocks away and registers species you have not met yet."
	]
	quest.5E968A2A70FEB0E3.title: "Senior Researcher"
	quest.5EAE34129F85BA3B.quest_desc: [
		"Hold a &ePoké Ball&r and throw it at a wild Pokémon. Weaken it in battle first for much better odds."
		""
		"A missed ball drops and can be picked up again; a ball the Pokémon breaks out of is lost."
		""
		"&aCatching during a battle also gives your battling Pokémon some EXP.&r"
	]
	quest.5EAE34129F85BA3B.title: "A New Friend!"
	quest.5ECB2AF2B2089679.quest_desc: [
		"Place four &eEnd Crystals&r on the edges of the exit portal to summon the dragon again for another fight and another load of XP."
		""
		"Remember: a second dragon drops no egg in this pack."
	]
	quest.5ECB2AF2B2089679.title: "Encore"
	quest.5F158357454A6419.quest_desc: ["Use a &eThunder Stone&r on Eevee."]
	quest.5F158357454A6419.title: "Jolteon"
	quest.5F2901E5F78FFBB1.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e5,000 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"Boosts the power of the holder's Psychic-type moves"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.5F2901E5F78FFBB1.quest_subtitle: "5,000 CD"
	quest.5F2901E5F78FFBB1.title: "Twisted Spoon"
	quest.5F2D1212A3C84940.quest_desc: [
		"Swim in a &6Warm Ocean&r."
		""
		"Luvdisc and Bruxish swim among the coral and Wiglett pokes out of the sea floor."
		"&oKyogre, ultra-rare, can appear underwater in the oceans.&r"
	]
	quest.5F2D1212A3C84940.title: "Coral Reef"
	quest.5F3BE53D9D0406B8.quest_desc: [
		"Surround a Carrot with eight &eGold Nuggets&r for a &eGolden Carrot&r, a treat horses and rabbits love."
		""
		"&aPokémon tie-in:&r a Golden Carrot is part of the &eCovert Cloak&r held item recipe."
	]
	quest.5F3BE53D9D0406B8.title: "Worth Its Weight"
	quest.5F4E0ED03DF4E35A.quest_desc: [
		"Scan a &6shiny&r Pokémon."
		""
		"Chat announces shiny spawns in your dimension. Get there fast with your Pokédex out."
	]
	quest.5F4E0ED03DF4E35A.title: "Sparkle Spotter"
	quest.5F52E53FC9E8C188.quest_desc: [
		"Mine the &eKeystone Ore&r with a &eDiamond Pickaxe&r or better to get a &eKeystone&r."
		"&cSilk Touch only gives you the ore block back.&r"
		""
		"&aNo Megaroid nearby? A Keystone can also be crafted from four Stellar Tera Shards, a Diamond, an Iron Ball, Lapis Lazuli, an Amethyst Shard and an Emerald. Stellar shards come from the Z-Moves, Tera and Dynamax chapter.&r"
	]
	quest.5F52E53FC9E8C188.title: "Set in Stone"
	quest.5F534B0309BBB5F1.quest_desc: [
		"&eShulkers&r hide in the walls of End Cities and fire homing bullets that make you float."
		""
		"Kill 10. Hit them while their shell is open. Their shells build Shulker Boxes and Cobblemon's Master Ball."
	]
	quest.5F534B0309BBB5F1.title: "Box Turtles"
	quest.5F545A95C629A85E.quest_desc: [
		"Craft an &eAbility Patch&r: an Ability Capsule, four Diamonds, three Gold Nuggets and Paper. It switches a Pokémon to its &ohidden&r ability."
		""
		"A second recipe uses a Nether Star, Diamonds and Iron instead."
	]
	quest.5F545A95C629A85E.title: "Hidden Talent"
	quest.5F856E21F6CFA65F.quest_desc: [
		"&e4 Planks&r, &e2 Chests&r, a &eComparator&r, a &eDiamond&r and an &eEnder Pearl&r."
		""
		"The heart of the network: it joins every inventory touching it into one. &eInventory Trims&r bridge the gaps between chests."
	]
	quest.5F856E21F6CFA65F.title: "Inventory Connector"
	quest.5FB98E47D3D8FCB9.quest_desc: ["Raise one Pokémon to &eDynamax Level 10&r, the cap in this pack."]
	quest.5FB98E47D3D8FCB9.title: "Maxed Out"
	quest.5FC70753E0A8E984.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e400 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"1× catch rate"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.5FC70753E0A8E984.quest_subtitle: "400 CD"
	quest.5FC70753E0A8E984.title: "Ancient Verdant Ball"
	quest.5FE2F6D3BFB01064.quest_desc: [
		"&e4 Stone&r, &e2 Comparators&r, &e2 Planks&r and a basic &eSophisticated Chest&r or &eBarrel&r in the middle."
		""
		"Place it touching your Sophisticated storage: everything connected becomes one block you can deposit into and pipe items from."
	]
	quest.5FE2F6D3BFB01064.title: "Storage Controller"
	quest.5FF3D9ED45A9D4FC.quest_desc: [
		"A &eMagnet Upgrade&r with a &eDiamond&r, &e2 Gold Ingots&r and &e3 Redstone&r."
		""
		"Range grows to &e5 blocks&r and the filter grows from 9 to 16 slots. Most basic upgrades have an Advanced version made the same way."
	]
	quest.5FF3D9ED45A9D4FC.title: "Advanced Magnet Upgrade"
	quest.5FFC7BA106DAF293.quest_desc: [
		"Drop a &eGold Ingot&r near a &ePiglin&r. It inspects the gold, then tosses back a random trade."
		""
		"Bartering can give Ender Pearls, Fire Resistance potions, String, Quartz, Obsidian, &eCrying Obsidian&r, Soul Sand, Leather and more."
		"&cTake off every piece of gold armor first. It only counts when you distract a hostile Piglin.&r"
		"For everyday bartering afterwards, put your gold back on."
	]
	quest.5FFC7BA106DAF293.title: "Gold for Goods"
	quest.6009BCD1E5D0A239.quest_desc: [
		"Catch 10 &6Rock&r-type Pokémon. Dual-type Pokémon count for both of their types."
		""
		"&6Strong against:&r Fire, Ice, Flying, Bug"
	]
	quest.6009BCD1E5D0A239.title: "Rock Collection"
	quest.600A74873292E790.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e4,000 CobbleDollars&r for 10."
		""
		"Increases a Pokémon's experience by 800 Exp. Points"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.600A74873292E790.quest_subtitle: "4,000 CD"
	quest.600A74873292E790.title: "Exp. Candy S x10"
	quest.6013D055BF15409D.quest_desc: [
		"Craft a &eTera Pouch&r from five Leather and a Blaze Powder to keep all your Tera Shards in one place."
		""
		"Add a dye on top for a colored pouch."
	]
	quest.6013D055BF15409D.title: "Shard Purse"
	quest.6057B76932961C88.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e600 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"Restores 10 PP to the first of the holder's moves to reach 0 PP"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.6057B76932961C88.quest_subtitle: "600 CD"
	quest.6057B76932961C88.title: "Leppa Berry"
	quest.608629E2240E2387.quest_desc: ["Get a &eTide&r armor trim template: Elder Guardians, the bosses of ocean monuments, drop it."]
	quest.608629E2240E2387.title: "Tide Trim"
	quest.609BF0ADDF50D1F4.quest_desc: [
		"Catch a Pokémon with a &eDusk Ball&r."
		""
		"&aCaves and dark nights are its home turf.&r"
	]
	quest.609BF0ADDF50D1F4.title: "Creature of the Night"
	quest.60B902343FD077AD.quest_desc: [
		"One of the new Megas from Pokémon Legends: Z-A."
		"Lets &eTatsugiri&r Mega Evolve."
		""
		"Recipe: raw Mega Stone, a Diamond, a &eWater Gem&r and two &eDragon Scales&r."
	]
	quest.60B902343FD077AD.title: "Tatsugirinite"
	quest.60C8EF75F92A005F.quest_desc: [
		"Peer into a &6Glacial Chasm&r."
		""
		"Bergmite is common here, and Cetoddle appears while it snows."
		"&oThe ultra-rare Kyurem prefers places this cold.&r"
	]
	quest.60C8EF75F92A005F.title: "Mind the Gap"
	quest.60CEB9452D8281DA.quest_desc: [
		"Revive a &eLileep&r (Rock/Grass) from a &eRoot Fossil&r."
		""
		"Look for it at hydrothermal vents, rooted pits, sandy dens, submerged impacts and underwater fissures."
	]
	quest.60CEB9452D8281DA.title: "Lileep"
	quest.60DB7C5F3756C997.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e1,000 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"1× to 4×, increases at night depending on how close the moon phase is to a full moon"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.60DB7C5F3756C997.quest_subtitle: "1,000 CD"
	quest.60DB7C5F3756C997.title: "Moon Ball"
	quest.60E0723569ACBA39.quest_desc: [
		"Place the box and feed it metal ingots until it holds 50 metal value. &dMeltan&r pops out."
		""
		"&aThe box then condenses &eMeltan Candy&a. Give your Meltan 64 to evolve it into Melmetal.&r"
	]
	quest.60E0723569ACBA39.title: "Hex Nut Delivery"
	quest.60F5EFCB040D8468.quest_desc: [
		"Hold &e50 Tera Shards&r of one type and use them on a Pokémon to change its Tera Type to that type."
		""
		"Shards drop from Pokémon you defeat, and a Stonecutter turns one Type Gem into five shards of its type."
	]
	quest.60F5EFCB040D8468.title: "Change of Heart"
	quest.60F712A6F7079F3E.quest_desc: [
		"Hover any item and press &eR&r for its recipes or &eU&r for its uses in the recipe viewer (REI)."
		""
		"Search a Pokémon in REI to open its &eCobbledex REI&r page: spawn biomes, evolutions, drops, moves and base stats."
		""
		"Choosing your starter also hands you the &eCobblepedia&r, an in-game Pokémon guide book. Lost it? Craft another from any Apricorn and a Book."
	]
	quest.60F712A6F7079F3E.title: "Look It Up"
	quest.610ED626040535AA.quest_desc: [
		"Each type has a Berry that halves one super-effective hit of that type. Start with the starter triangle:"
		"&eOcca&r (Fire), &ePassho&r (Water) and &eRindo&r (Grass)."
		""
		"Occa likes hot, sandy or volcanic land, Passho the coasts and fresh water, Rindo jungles and lush caves."
	]
	quest.610ED626040535AA.title: "Starter Insurance"
	quest.611F2FD2505E5167.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e1,000,000 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"Guaranteed capture"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.611F2FD2505E5167.quest_subtitle: "1,000,000 CD"
	quest.611F2FD2505E5167.title: "Ancient Origin Ball"
	quest.6122B2D8480C70DC.quest_desc: [
		"&eCobblemon Loot Plus&r adds a Pokémon pool to structure chests: Poké Balls, medicine, EXP Candy, berries and Relic Coins in ordinary chests."
		""
		"Treasure rooms can roll held items, mints, Mega Stones and Z-Crystals. Check every chest."
	]
	quest.6122B2D8480C70DC.title: "Pokémon in the Pantry"
	quest.613142AA8306467F.quest_desc: [
		"Eight planks around a sheet of &ePaper&r. Pin a &eWritten Book&r or a &eMap&r to a &eNotice Board&r and its contents show on the front."
		""
		"Post the rules of your town or a map of the best shiny-hunting spots."
	]
	quest.613142AA8306467F.title: "Bulletin Board"
	quest.61423E19C0E2ED17.quest_desc: [
		"&6Job sites&r"
		"A villager without a job claims a free &ejob site&r block nearby and takes on its profession."
		"Swap the block to change the job, but only before you trade with that villager: one trade locks it in."
		""
		"The grid covers all thirteen job sites. Linked cells point to the chapter that already teaches that block."
	]
	quest.61423E19C0E2ED17.title: "Everyone Needs a Job"
	quest.6155787658DCC941.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e50,000 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"Changes the ability of the Pokémon it is used on to their alternative hidden ability"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.6155787658DCC941.quest_subtitle: "50,000 CD"
	quest.6155787658DCC941.title: "Ability Patch"
	quest.616A045EFB38EFF1.quest_desc: [
		"Find a &eSun Stone Ore&r: it generates under badlands, grasslands and dripstone caves, more rarely under deserts and tropical islands. In badlands it can replace terracotta."
		"Look at the regular stone variant, found above the deepslate layer."
		""
		"&aPokémon tip:&r this stone evolves Pokémon such as Gloom, Sunkern and Cottonee."
	]
	quest.616A045EFB38EFF1.title: "Sun Stone Ore"
	quest.6173FD5E683632A1.quest_desc: [
		"Four &eNetherite Scrap&r and four &eGold Ingots&r make one &eNetherite Ingot&r, the strongest metal in the game."
		""
		"Cobblemon's &eMaster Ball&r recipe needs two Netherite Ingots, along with a Nether Star and two Shulker Shells."
	]
	quest.6173FD5E683632A1.title: "Netherite!"
	quest.61782A3EFB79CE17.quest_desc: [
		"Explore one of &eYUNG's Better Mineshafts&r, found between Y -55 and Y 30."
		""
		"They come in styles to match the biome above: oak, spruce, desert, ice, jungle, lush, mesa, mushroom and more."
	]
	quest.61782A3EFB79CE17.title: "Down the Shaft"
	quest.617FB373609CD12F.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e6,000 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"Increases damage dealt by the binding status"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.617FB373609CD12F.quest_subtitle: "6,000 CD"
	quest.617FB373609CD12F.title: "Binding Band"
	quest.618020CFE0DB6118.quest_desc: ["String over Honeycomb makes a &eCandle&r. Dye it, group up to four on one block, and light them up."]
	quest.618020CFE0DB6118.title: "Burning the Midnight Oil"
	quest.61977759E0943F8F.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e5,000 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"Raises the Pokémon's Defense EVs by 10"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.61977759E0943F8F.quest_subtitle: "5,000 CD"
	quest.61977759E0943F8F.title: "Iron"
	quest.61AF8E3FA2C50BE5.quest_desc: [
		"&eLarvesta&r is an uncommon find in &eCrimson Forests&r."
		""
		"Be patient with it: Larvesta only evolves into the blazing &eVolcarona&r at level 59."
	]
	quest.61AF8E3FA2C50BE5.title: "Sun in the Making"
	quest.61B4211CA96AA357.quest_desc: [
		"&e4 Nether Stars&r and &e4 End Crystals&r around an &eUpgrade Base&r. Pricey!"
		""
		"The backpack becomes indestructible: it cannot despawn or fall into the void."
	]
	quest.61B4211CA96AA357.title: "Everlasting Upgrade"
	quest.61B7A95425836946.quest_desc: [
		"Revive every single-fossil Pokémon: Omanyte, Kabuto, Aerodactyl, Lileep, Anorith, Cranidos, Shieldon, Tirtouga, Archen, Tyrunt and Amaura."
		""
		"Click the checkmark once all eleven are done."
	]
	quest.61B7A95425836946.title: "Living Museum"
	quest.61C1925BC7C0F4D7.quest_desc: [
		"Step into a &6Dark Forest&r."
		""
		"Sinistea and Polteageist haunt the gloom, Foongus hides in dark corners, and a rare Mimikyu may be lurking."
		"&aTip:&r woodland mansions stand in these forests (see &eStructure Hunter&r)."
	]
	quest.61C1925BC7C0F4D7.title: "Under the Canopy"
	quest.61C68494765BC1A4.quest_desc: ["Craft a &eDisc Shelf&r from Iron Ingots and Iron Nuggets."]
	quest.61C68494765BC1A4.title: "Disc Shelf"
	quest.61C7AE77BBC8A621.quest_desc: [
		"Your starter kit already covers iron tools and food, so skip the wooden age: build a base, fire up a furnace, then dig for iron, gold and diamonds."
		""
		"Every step also feeds your Pokémon journey. &eCopper&r, &eIron&r and &eGold&r end up in Poké Balls, Healing Machines and PCs."
		""
		"&aQuests can be done in any order. When unsure, follow the lines.&r"
	]
	quest.61C7AE77BBC8A621.quest_subtitle: "Survive, settle, dig deeper"
	quest.61C7AE77BBC8A621.title: "&lFirst Days&r"
	quest.61CD980C63487BAE.quest_desc: ["Explore all four kinds of Better Dungeon: monster room, catacomb, spider cave and undead fortress."]
	quest.61CD980C63487BAE.title: "Professional Dungeoneer"
	quest.61CE1040C560736F.quest_desc: [
		"Ancient Cities sprawl inside the Deep Dark. Their chests hold &eEcho Shards&r, music disc fragments, sculk sensors and the odd enchanted golden apple."
		""
		"&cMove quietly and light your way out.&r"
	]
	quest.61CE1040C560736F.title: "City of Echoes"
	quest.61CE1ADFF8E049DD.quest_desc: [
		"Cook &ePoké Bait&r in a Campfire Pot (Honey Bottle, any Mushroom, Wheat; 4 per batch). Season it with Berries or golden fruit and it carries their bait effects."
		""
		"Put it on your rod and reel in a Pokémon with it."
	]
	quest.61CE1ADFF8E049DD.title: "Hook, Line and Snack"
	quest.61E0791B291C7B18.quest_desc: [
		"In open water a Poké Rod can reel up its own treasure: &ePrism Scales&r, &eDragon Scales&r, &eKing's Rocks&r, &eDeep Sea Teeth&r and &eDeep Sea Scales&r, all trade-evolution items."
		""
		"Fish until a Prism Scale bites."
	]
	quest.61E0791B291C7B18.title: "Scale of Beauty"
	quest.620E955DE4719F5D.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e15,000 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"Boosts the holder's Sp. Atk, but locks it into only using one move"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.620E955DE4719F5D.quest_subtitle: "15,000 CD"
	quest.620E955DE4719F5D.title: "Choice Specs"
	quest.6216464F6ADACF5B.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e600 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"Restores 60 HP of a Pokémon whilst slightly reducing Friendship"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.6216464F6ADACF5B.quest_subtitle: "600 CD"
	quest.6216464F6ADACF5B.title: "Fine Remedy"
	quest.621CDB7C45214327.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e3,000 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"Evolves Applin into Appletun"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.621CDB7C45214327.quest_subtitle: "3,000 CD"
	quest.621CDB7C45214327.title: "Sweet Apple"
	quest.62224AE426B6F409.quest_desc: [
		"&eCocoa Beans&r grow on jungle trees. Two Wheat around one Cocoa Bean bakes &e8 Cookies&r."
		""
		"A cheap snack for long trips into the wild."
	]
	quest.62224AE426B6F409.title: "Cookie Jar"
	quest.6238D503A2609850.quest_desc: [
		"Galar fossils come in halves. Put a &eFossilized Bird&r or &eFossilized Fish&r into the analyzer together with a &eFossilized Drake&r or &eFossilized Dino&r."
		""
		"Bird + Drake = Dracozolt, Bird + Dino = Arctozolt, Fish + Drake = Dracovish, Fish + Dino = Arctovish."
	]
	quest.6238D503A2609850.title: "Didn't Stop to Think"
	quest.62440B5A95AC2D0F.quest_desc: [
		"Evolve any Pokémon. When one is ready you will see \"&oit seems ready to evolve!&r\"."
		""
		"Open your party, pick the Pokémon and press &eEvolve&r. It only evolves once you confirm, so you can wait if you like."
	]
	quest.62440B5A95AC2D0F.title: "Something Is Happening!"
	quest.62441736D6763627.quest_desc: ["Find a &eCoast&r armor trim template in a shipwreck chest."]
	quest.62441736D6763627.title: "Coast Trim"
	quest.6250D4F4EBF5F0CA.quest_desc: [
		"Catch 10 &8Dark&r-type Pokémon. Dual-type Pokémon count for both of their types."
		""
		"&6Strong against:&r Psychic, Ghost"
	]
	quest.6250D4F4EBF5F0CA.title: "Into the Dark"
	quest.62603DC4406F71AC.quest_desc: [
		"Craft a &ePoké Treat&r: four Paper around any EXP Candy or a Rare Candy."
		""
		"Feeding one to a Pokémon raises its friendship, which several evolutions need."
		"&aTip:&r a Pokémon holding a &eSoothe Bell&r (Training and Battling chapter) gains friendship faster."
	]
	quest.62603DC4406F71AC.title: "Treat Yourself"
	quest.62652BB040946A15.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e5,000 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"Extends the duration of Harsh Sunlight"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.62652BB040946A15.quest_subtitle: "5,000 CD"
	quest.62652BB040946A15.title: "Heat Rock"
	quest.627686DD49648DB7.quest_desc: [
		"Craft an &eEnchanting Table&r: a Book on top, 2 Diamonds and 4 Obsidian."
		""
		"Put an item and some &eLapis Lazuli&r in it and it shows three random enchantment offers, each with its level and Lapis cost."
		"&aThe offers stay weak until Bookshelves surround the table.&r"
	]
	quest.627686DD49648DB7.title: "The Enchanting Table"
	quest.6281EF084CAE82C1.quest_desc: [
		"Find an &eigloo&r in the snow."
		""
		"Snorunt and Froslass gather around it while it snows."
		"&aTip:&r some igloos hide a basement under the floor."
	]
	quest.6281EF084CAE82C1.title: "Snowed In"
	quest.628CD3A0F46608D3.quest_desc: [
		"You received the &ePoképedia&r guide book when you picked your starter."
		""
		"It explains spawning, Poké Balls, battling and Cobblemon's own Pokémon forms. Lost it? Craft a new one from any Apricorn and a Book."
	]
	quest.628CD3A0F46608D3.title: "Read the Manual"
	quest.628F36089A5CCBFD.quest_desc: [
		"Classic netherrack plains with &eZombified Piglins&r, Piglins and Ghasts."
		""
		"&6Pokémon:&r Numel, Ponyta, Magby, Magmar, Slugma and Sizzlipede."
		"Gastly, Charcadet and Honedge can turn up in any Nether biome."
		"Team Rocket Grunts and Veterans roam every Nether biome, and the Cinnabar Gym can generate in the wastes."
	]
	quest.628F36089A5CCBFD.title: "Nether Wastes"
	quest.62A680DDB0BFD6CD.quest_desc: [
		"Register &e40&r species from the &ePaldea&r region (Generation 9) as caught."
		""
		"Regional forms count for their own region (an Alolan form counts toward Alola). Hisuian forms count toward Galar."
	]
	quest.62A680DDB0BFD6CD.title: "Paldea Field Notes"
	quest.62F1658B6EBDC4FE.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e3,000 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"Evolves certain Pokémon"
		""
		"&aClick the checkmark to buy. Buy again as often as you like: you are only charged when you can afford it.&r"
	]
	quest.62F1658B6EBDC4FE.quest_subtitle: "3,000 CD"
	quest.62F1658B6EBDC4FE.title: "Leaf Stone"
	quest.62F818FD06CF620A.quest_desc: ["The &bThroneroom of Knightly Heroes&r is found in the plains. Claim the &eHero Sword&r at the end of the sword path, then place it and a Totem on the paired pedestals. &dZacian&r rises and gives you a Rusted Sword."]
	quest.62F818FD06CF620A.title: "The Hero Sword"
	quest.6322EA4FC163BD79.quest_desc: [
		"&6Price:&r &e1,500 CobbleDollars&r for one."
		""
		"Halves damage taken from a supereffective Flying-type attack"
		""
